istricted-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-redistricted_3-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">As a result of redistricting.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">As a result of death, resignation, or expulsion.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-121\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-121\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Amnesty_International\" title=\"Amnesty International\">Amnesty International</a>,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;Amnesty&#95;International&#95;Dec&#95;2024&#95;116-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Gaza_genocide_Amnesty_International_Dec_2024-116\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>113<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <a href=\"/wiki/M%C3%A9decins_Sans_Fronti%C3%A8res\" title=\"Médecins Sans Frontières\">Médecins Sans Frontières</a>,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-117\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-117\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>114<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <a href=\"/wiki/B%27Tselem\" title=\"B&#39;Tselem\">B'Tselem</a>,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-118\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-118\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>115<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <a href=\"/wiki/Physicians_for_Human_Rights%E2%80%93Israel\" title=\"Physicians for Human Rights–Israel\">Physicians for Human Rights–Israel</a>,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;Kottasová&#95;&amp;&#95;Salman&#95;119-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Gaza_genocide_Kottasová_&amp;_Salman-119\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>116<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <a href=\"/wiki/International_Federation_for_Human_Rights\" title=\"International Federation for Human Rights\">International Federation for Human Rights</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;FIDH&#95;2023&#95;120-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Gaza_genocide_FIDH_2023-120\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>117<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-165\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-165\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Calculated by taking the difference of 100% and all other candidates combined.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-key-207\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-key_207-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-key_207-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Key:<br />A – all adults<br />RV – registered voters<br />LV – likely voters</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Other2-211\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-Other2_211-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Other2_211-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Other2_211-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Other2_211-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Other2_211-4\"><sup><i><b>e</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Other\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-O3WNV3-212\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-O3WNV3_212-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-O3WNV3_212-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Other\" and \"I would not vote\" with 3%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-218\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-218\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Will not/do not plan to vote\" with 5%; \"Candidate from another political party\" with 3%; \"Skipped\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Ipsos1531-219\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-Ipsos1531_219-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Ipsos1531_219-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Ipsos1531_219-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Ipsos1531_219-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Will not/do not plan to vote\" with 15%; \"Candidate from another political party\" with 3%; \"Skipped\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-AC2-221\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-AC2_221-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-AC2_221-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Another candidate\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-224\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-224\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Other party\" with 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-lean-225\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-4\"><sup><i><b>e</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-5\"><sup><i><b>f</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-6\"><sup><i><b>g</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-7\"><sup><i><b>h</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-8\"><sup><i><b>i</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-9\"><sup><i><b>j</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-10\"><sup><i><b>k</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-11\"><sup><i><b>l</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-12\"><sup><i><b>m</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-13\"><sup><i><b>n</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-14\"><sup><i><b>o</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-15\"><sup><i><b>p</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-16\"><sup><i><b>q</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-17\"><sup><i><b>r</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-18\"><sup><i><b>s</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-19\"><sup><i><b>t</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-20\"><sup><i><b>u</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-21\"><sup><i><b>v</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-22\"><sup><i><b>w</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-23\"><sup><i><b>x</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-24\"><sup><i><b>y</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-25\"><sup><i><b>z</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-26\"><sup><i><b>aa</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-27\"><sup><i><b>ab</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-28\"><sup><i><b>ac</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-29\"><sup><i><b>ad</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-30\"><sup><i><b>ae</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-31\"><sup><i><b>af</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-32\"><sup><i><b>ag</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-33\"><sup><i><b>ah</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-34\"><sup><i><b>ai</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-35\"><sup><i><b>aj</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-36\"><sup><i><b>ak</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-lean_225-37\"><sup><i><b>al</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">With voters who lean towards a given candidate</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-226\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-226\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Other party\" with 5%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-229\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-229\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Another Party's Candidate\" with 2%; \"No Response\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-231\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-231\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Someone else/third party\" with 7%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-232\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-232\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Someone else/third party\" with 8%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-235\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-235\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Independent/another candidate\" with 10%; \"Do not plan to vote\" with 8%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-241\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-241\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Will not/do not plan to vote\" with 4%; \"Candidate from another political party\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV3O1-245\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O1_245-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O1_245-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O1_245-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O1_245-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O1_245-4\"><sup><i><b>e</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O1_245-5\"><sup><i><b>f</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O1_245-6\"><sup><i><b>g</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O1_245-7\"><sup><i><b>h</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O1_245-8\"><sup><i><b>i</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O1_245-9\"><sup><i><b>j</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O1_245-10\"><sup><i><b>k</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 3%; \"Other\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV4O3-246\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV4O3_246-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV4O3_246-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 4%; \"Other\" with 3%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-248\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-248\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 5%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-253\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-253\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Would not vote\" with 19%; \"Vote another candidate\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Neither4-255\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-Neither4_255-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Neither4_255-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Neither\" with 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-256\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-256\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Neither\" with 7%; \"Would not vote\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-257\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-257\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Neither\" with 8%; \"Would not vote\" with 5%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Other3-262\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-Other3_262-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Other3_262-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Other3_262-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Other3_262-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Other3_262-4\"><sup><i><b>e</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Other3_262-5\"><sup><i><b>f</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Other\" with 3%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Other4-263\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-Other4_263-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Other4_263-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Other4_263-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Other\" with 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV5O4-264\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV5O4_264-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV5O4_264-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV5O4_264-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 5%; \"Other\" with 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV9O4-265\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV9O4_265-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV9O4_265-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 9%; \"Other\" with 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-267\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-267\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Will not/do not plan to vote\" with 3%; \"Candidate from another political party\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-268\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-268\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Will not/do not plan to vote\" with 13%; \"Candidate from another political party\" with 3%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-271\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-271\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"An Independent Candidate\" with 10%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV2O1-276\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O1_276-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O1_276-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O1_276-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O1_276-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O1_276-4\"><sup><i><b>e</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O1_276-5\"><sup><i><b>f</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O1_276-6\"><sup><i><b>g</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O1_276-7\"><sup><i><b>h</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O1_276-8\"><sup><i><b>i</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O1_276-9\"><sup><i><b>j</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O1_276-10\"><sup><i><b>k</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 2%; \"Other\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV16O1-277\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV16O1_277-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV16O1_277-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV16O1_277-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV16O1_277-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 16%; \"Other\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-280\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-280\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Candidate from another political party\" with 5%; \"Will not/do not plan to vote\" with 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Ipsos1441-281\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-Ipsos1441_281-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Ipsos1441_281-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Will not/do not plan to vote\" with 14%; \"Candidate from another political party\" with 4%; \"Skipped\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-IC10-283\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-IC10_283-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-IC10_283-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Independent Candidate\" with 10%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-288\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-288\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Another party's candidate\" with 3%; \"Rather not say\" with 3%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV4-290\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV4_290-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV4_290-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Would not vote\" with 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV4O4-292\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV4O4_292-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" and \"Other\" with 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-293\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-293\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 7%; \"Other\" with 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-ITP6-296\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-ITP6_296-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-ITP6_296-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-ITP6_296-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"An independent or third-party candidate\" with 6%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV2O2-298\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O2_298-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O2_298-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O2_298-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O2_298-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O2_298-4\"><sup><i><b>e</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O2_298-5\"><sup><i><b>f</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O2_298-6\"><sup><i><b>g</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O2_298-7\"><sup><i><b>h</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O2_298-8\"><sup><i><b>i</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O2_298-9\"><sup><i><b>j</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O2_298-10\"><sup><i><b>k</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O2_298-11\"><sup><i><b>l</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2O2_298-12\"><sup><i><b>m</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" &amp; \"Other\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV15O2-299\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV15O2_299-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV15O2_299-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV15O2_299-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 15%; \"Other\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-306\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-306\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Will not/do not plan to vote\" with 4%; \"Candidate from another political party\" with 3%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-307\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-307\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Will not/do not plan to vote\" with 15%; \"Candidate from another political party\" with 4%; \"Skipped\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SETP10-309\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP10_309-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP10_309-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP10_309-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP10_309-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP10_309-4\"><sup><i><b>e</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Someone else / third party\" with 10%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SETP7-310\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP7_310-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP7_310-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP7_310-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP7_310-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP7_310-4\"><sup><i><b>e</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP7_310-5\"><sup><i><b>f</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Someone else / third party\" with 7%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SETP13-311\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP13_311-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP13_311-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP13_311-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Someone else / third party\" with 13%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SETP8-312\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP8_312-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP8_312-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP8_312-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP8_312-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Someone else / third party\" with 8%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-314\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-314\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Neither\" with 8%; \"Would not vote\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-N9WNV5-315\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-N9WNV5_315-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-N9WNV5_315-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Neither\" with 9%; \"Would not vote\" with 5%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-319\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-319\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Will not/do not plan to vote\" and \"Candidate from another political party\" with 3%; \"Skipped\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-320\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-320\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Will not/do not plan to vote\" with 13%; \"Candidate from another political party\" with 4%; \"Skipped\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Matter7-323\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-Matter7_323-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Matter7_323-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Doesn't matter either way\" with 7%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV16O2-329\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV16O2_329-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV16O2_329-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV16O2_329-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 16%; \"Other\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-332\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-332\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 7%; \"Another candidate\" with 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV3-336\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3_336-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3_336-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3_336-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3_336-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3_336-4\"><sup><i><b>e</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3_336-5\"><sup><i><b>f</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3_336-6\"><sup><i><b>g</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Would not vote\" with 3%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV3O2-338\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O2_338-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O2_338-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O2_338-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O2_338-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O2_338-4\"><sup><i><b>e</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O2_338-5\"><sup><i><b>f</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O2_338-6\"><sup><i><b>g</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O2_338-7\"><sup><i><b>h</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O2_338-8\"><sup><i><b>i</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O2_338-9\"><sup><i><b>j</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O2_338-10\"><sup><i><b>k</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O2_338-11\"><sup><i><b>l</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 3%; \"Other\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-346\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-346\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Not sure\" with 14%; \"Another/Lean to another candidate\" with 5%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-351\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-351\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Independent/Other/Minor party\" with 15%; \"Not sure/Will not vote\" with 7%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-354\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-354\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Other\" with 4%; \"I wouldn't vote\" with 3%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Other5-357\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-Other5_357-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Other5_357-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Other\" with 5%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-358\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-358\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 10%; \"Other\" with 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SETP9-362\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP9_362-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP9_362-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Someone else / third party\" with 9%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SETP5-363\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP5_363-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP5_363-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Someone else / third party\" with 5%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SETP14-364\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP14_364-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP14_364-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Someone else / third party\" with 14%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-367\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-367\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Neither\" with 11; \"Would not vote\" with 5%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV15O1-370\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV15O1_370-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV15O1_370-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV15O1_370-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV15O1_370-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 15%; \"Other\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-372\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-372\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Will not/do not plan to vote\" with 6%; \"Candidate from another political party\" with 3%; \"Skipped\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SE3-378\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-SE3_378-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SE3_378-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SE3_378-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Someone else\" with 3%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-380\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-380\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Third party / Independent\" with 9%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-381\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-381\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Third party / Independent\" with 8%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV17O1-386\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV17O1_386-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 17%; \"Other\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Ipsos1431-388\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-Ipsos1431_388-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Ipsos1431_388-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Will not/do not plan to vote\" with 14%; \"Candidate from another political party\" with 3%; \"Skipped\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-393\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-393\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Some other candidate\" with 8%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-IND11-403\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-IND11_403-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-IND11_403-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Independent candidate\" with 11%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV14O2-406\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV14O2_406-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV14O2_406-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV14O2_406-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV14O2_406-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV14O2_406-4\"><sup><i><b>e</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 14%; \"Other\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV14O1-411\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV14O1_411-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV14O1_411-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV14O1_411-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV14O1_411-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV14O1_411-4\"><sup><i><b>e</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 14%; \"Other\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-N7WNV1-413\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-N7WNV1_413-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-N7WNV1_413-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Neither\" with 7%; \"Would not vote\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-415\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-415\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Will not vote\" with 5%; \"Third party candidate\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-420\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-420\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Would not vote\" with 7%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SOC4-422\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-SOC4_422-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SOC4_422-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SOC4_422-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Some other candidate\" with 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-425\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-425\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 5%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV4O2-437\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV4O2_437-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV4O2_437-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV4O2_437-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV4O2_437-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV4O2_437-4\"><sup><i><b>e</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 4%; \"Other\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-439\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-439\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Will not/do not plan to vote\" with 14%; \"Candidate from another political party\" with 5%; \"Skipped\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV2-445\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2_445-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2_445-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2_445-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2_445-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2_445-4\"><sup><i><b>e</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2_445-5\"><sup><i><b>f</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2_445-6\"><sup><i><b>g</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2_445-7\"><sup><i><b>h</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2_445-8\"><sup><i><b>i</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2_445-9\"><sup><i><b>j</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2_445-10\"><sup><i><b>k</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2_445-11\"><sup><i><b>l</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2_445-12\"><sup><i><b>m</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2_445-13\"><sup><i><b>n</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2_445-14\"><sup><i><b>o</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2_445-15\"><sup><i><b>p</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV2_445-16\"><sup><i><b>q</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Would not vote\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Other1-447\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-Other1_447-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Other1_447-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Other1_447-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Other\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-449\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-449\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 5%; \"Other\" with 3%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-450\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-450\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 11%; \"Other\" with 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV13O2-452\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV13O2_452-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV13O2_452-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV13O2_452-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV13O2_452-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 13%; \"Other\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-454\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-454\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Neither\" with 11%; \"Do not plan to vote\" with 3%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-AC4-456\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-AC4_456-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-AC4_456-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Another candidate\" with 4%\"</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SETP6-458\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP6_458-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP6_458-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP6_458-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP6_458-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP6_458-4\"><sup><i><b>e</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Someone else / third party\" with 6%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-460\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-460\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Would not vote\" with 6%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV12O2-462\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV12O2_462-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV12O2_462-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 12%; \"Other\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-464\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-464\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Will not/do not plan to vote\" with 15%; \"Candidate from another political party\" with 3%; \"Don't know\" with 14%; \"Skipped\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-478\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-478\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Undecided\" with 14%; \"Neither/another party\" with 5%; \"I wouldn't vote\" with 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-480\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-480\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Other party\" 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-482\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-482\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Neither\" with 6%; \"Would not vote\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-483\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-483\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Neither\" with 10%; \"Would not vote\" with 5%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-495\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-495\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 15%; \"Another candidate\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-497\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-497\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Neither\" with 8%; \"Do not plan to vote\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SETP12-501\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP12_501-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP12_501-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Someone else / third party\" with 12%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SOC5-505\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-SOC5_505-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SOC5_505-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Some other candidate\" with 5%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-512\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-512\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Depends\" with 12%; \"Neither\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-514\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-514\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Will not/do not plan to vote\" with 12%; \"Candidate from another political party\" with 3%; \"Skipped\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-516\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-516\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Other party\" with 3%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SOC3-518\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-SOC3_518-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Some other candidate\" with 3%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV13O1-524\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV13O1_524-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV13O1_524-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 13%; \"Other\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-AC5-529\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-AC5_529-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-AC5_529-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Another candidate\" with 5%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-530\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-530\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" and \"Another candidate\" with 5%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-531\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-531\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 11%; \"Another candidate\" with 5%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-542\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-542\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Third party / Independent\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-543\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-543\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Third party / Independent\" with 3%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-545\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-545\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Doesn't matter either way\" with 8%, \"Not sure\" with 7%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-555\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-555\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Third party candidate\" and \"Would not vote\" with 3%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-557\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-557\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Will not/do not plan to vote\" with 15%; \"Don't know\" with 14%; \"Candidate from another political party\" with 4%; \"Skipped\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-563\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-563\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I wouldn't vote\" with 9%; \"Other\" with 5%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-568\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-568\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Would not vote\" with 8%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-569\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-569\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Would not vote\" with 18%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-572\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-572\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Will not/do not plan to vote\" with 15%; \"Don't know\" with 14%; \"Candidate from another political party\" with 3%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-TPO3-574\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-TPO3_574-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-TPO3_574-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Third party/other\" with 3%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-AC7-578\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-AC7_578-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Another candidate\" with 7%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-579\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-579\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Another candidate\" and \"I would not vote\" with 6%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-580\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-580\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 14%; \"Another candidate\" with 6%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-584\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-584\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Another party\" with 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-589\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-589\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Third party\" with 5%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-590\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-590\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Third party\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-594\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-594\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Neither\" with 3%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-595\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-595\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Neither\" with 10%; \"Would not vote\" with 7%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV3O3-600\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O3_600-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV3O3_600-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" &amp; \"Other\" with 3%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV11O2-601\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV11O2_601-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 11%; \"Other\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SETP4-604\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP4_604-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-SETP4_604-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Someone else / third party\" with 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-OC2-606\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-OC2_606-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Other candidate\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-616\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-616\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Some other candidate\" with 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-626\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-626\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Other / third-party / Independent\" with 11%; \"I would not vote\" with 3%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-627\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-627\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Other / third-party / Independent\" with 10%; \"I would not vote\" with 9%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV4O1-631\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV4O1_631-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV4O1_631-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV4O1_631-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 4%; \"Other\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WNV1-634\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV1_634-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WNV1_634-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Would not vote\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-655\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-655\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Other/third-party/Independent\" and \"I would not vote\" with 7%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-656\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-656\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 12%; \"Other/third-party/Independent\" with 6%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-666\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-666\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Another Party\" with 7%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-671\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-671\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Neither\" with 6%; \"Would not vote\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-672\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-672\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Neither\" with 9%; \"Would not vote\" with 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-O3WNV2-678\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-O3WNV2_678-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Other\" with 3%; \"I would not vote\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-681\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-681\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Do not plan to vote\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-683\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-683\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Third-party candidate\" with 7%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-684\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-684\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Third-party candidate\" with 7%; \"Would not vote\" with 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-688\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-688\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Would not vote\" with 9%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-697\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-697\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 14%; \"Another candidate\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-719\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-719\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"I would not vote\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-722\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-722\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">The association's members are Big Data Poll, InsiderAdvantage, <a href=\"/wiki/Rasmussen_Reports\" title=\"Rasmussen Reports\">Rasmussen Reports</a>, &amp; the <a href=\"/wiki/Trafalgar_Group\" title=\"Trafalgar Group\">Trafalgar Group</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-726\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-726\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Other candidate\" with 10%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-730\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-730\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Would not vote\" with 12%; \"Other/third-party candidate\" with 4%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-740\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-740\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Will not/do not plan to vote\" with 8%; \"Candidate from another political party\" with 4%; \"Skipped\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-758\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-758\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Refused\" with 1%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-766\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-766\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/America_Party\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"America Party\">America Party</a> candidate with 5%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-773\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-773\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"Or Another Third Party Candidate\" with 2%</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-795\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-795\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\"A third-party candidate\" with 9%; \"Would not vote\" with 6%</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<p><b>Partisan clients</b><br />\n</p>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1327269900\" /><div>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap mw-references-columns\"><ol class=\"references\" data-mw-group=\"upper-alpha\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-NPRPBS-228\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-NPRPBS_228-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-NPRPBS_228-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-NPRPBS_228-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-NPRPBS_228-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Poll sponsored by <i><a href=\"/wiki/NPR\" title=\"NPR\">NPR</a></i> and <i><a href=\"/wiki/PBS_News\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"PBS News\">PBS News</a></i></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-234\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-234\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Poll sponsored by the United America Institute</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-NBC-237\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-NBC_237-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-NBC_237-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-NBC_237-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-NBC_237-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Poll conducted for <i><a href=\"/wiki/NBC_News\" title=\"NBC News\">NBC News</a></i></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-NNS-239\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-NNS_239-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-NNS_239-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-NNS_239-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-NNS_239-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-NNS_239-4\"><sup><i><b>e</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-NNS_239-5\"><sup><i><b>f</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-NNS_239-6\"><sup><i><b>g</b></i></sup></