WSJ_433-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WSJ_433-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-WSJ_433-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Poll conducted for <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Wall_Street_Journal\" title=\"The Wall Street Journal\">The Wall Street Journal</a></i></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-CEN-442\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-CEN_442-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Poll sponsored by the Conservative Energy Network</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-CoinDesk-466\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-CoinDesk_466-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Poll commissioned by <a href=\"/wiki/CoinDesk\" title=\"CoinDesk\">CoinDesk</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Net-491\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Net_491-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Poll sponsored by <a href=\"/wiki/NetChoice\" title=\"NetChoice\">NetChoice</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-509\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-509\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Poll commissioned by Gambling is Not Investing</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-511\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-511\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Poll sponsored by <a href=\"/wiki/Third_Way_(United_States)\" title=\"Third Way (United States)\">Third Way</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/UnidosUS\" title=\"UnidosUS\">UnidosUS</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-APP-549\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-APP_549-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Poll sponsored by the <a href=\"/wiki/American_Principles_Project\" title=\"American Principles Project\">American Principles Project</a>, which supports Republicans</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-AOP-551\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=