orseSchaul2026\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Ovide, Shira; Morse, Clara Ence; Schaul, Kevin (August 14, 2026). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/technology/2026/08/14/ai-becomes-major-election-issue-first-time-data-shows/\">\"The unexpected issue dividing parties and midterms candidates\"</a>. <i>The Washington Post</i>. <a href=\"/wiki/ISSN_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ISSN (identifier)\">ISSN</a>&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://search.worldcat.org/issn/0190-8286\">0190-8286</a><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">September 26,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Washington+Post&amp;rft.atitle=The+unexpected+issue+dividing+parties+and+midterms+candidates&amp;rft.date=2026-08-14&amp;rft.issn=0190-8286&amp;rft.aulast=Ovide&amp;rft.aufirst=Shira&amp;rft.au=Morse%2C+Clara+Ence&amp;rft.au=Schaul%2C+Kevin&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.washingtonpost.com%2Ftechnology%2F2026%2F08%2F14%2Fai-becomes-major-election-issue-first-time-data-shows%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-R&#95;Street&#95;Institute-7\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-R_Street_Institute_7-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-R_Street_Institute_7-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.rstreet.org/commentary/ai-and-elections-what-to-watch-for-in-2026/\">\"AI and Elections: What to Watch for in 2026\"</a>. <i>R Street Institute</i><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span c