ev2026\" class=\"citation web cs1\">Pager, Tyler; Kurmanaev, Anatoly (July 11, 2026). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/11/us/politics/how-marco-rubio-runs-venezuela.html\">\"How Marco Rubio Is Running Venezuela From Afar\"</a>. <i>The New York Times</i><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">July 13,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=The+New+York+Times&amp;rft.atitle=How+Marco+Rubio+Is+Running+Venezuela+From+Afar&amp;rft.date=2026-07-11&amp;rft.aulast=Pager&amp;rft.aufirst=Tyler&amp;rft.au=Kurmanaev%2C+Anatoly&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nytimes.com%2F2026%2F07%2F11%2Fus%2Fpolitics%2Fhow-marco-rubio-runs-venezuela.html&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-American&#95;expansionism&#95;under&#95;Donald&#95;Trump&#95;NYTimes&#95;20260108-107\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-American_expansionism_under_Donald_Trump_NYTimes_20260108_107-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-American_expansionism_under_Donald_Trump_NYTimes_20260108_107-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFSangerPagerRogersKanno-Youngs2026\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Sanger, David E.; Pager, Tyler; Rogers, Katie; Kanno-Youngs, Zolan (January 8, 2026). <span class=\"id-lock-subscription\" title=\"Paid subscription required\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/01/08/us/politics/trump-interview-power-morality.html\">\"Trump Lays Out a Vision of Power Restrained Only by 'My Own Morality'<span class=\"cs1-kern-right\"></span>\"</a></span>. <i>The New York Times</i>.</ci