.amnesty.org.uk%2Fpress-releases%2Fisraels-genocide-against-palestinians-not-over-despite-ceasefire-new-amnesty&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li><li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation news cs1\"><a href=\"/wiki/Raz_Segal\" title=\"Raz Segal\">Segal, Raz</a> (November 28, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2025/nov/28/the-genocide-in-gaza-is-far-from-over\">\"The genocide in Gaza is far from over\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Guardian\" title=\"The Guardian\">The Guardian</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20251128115413/https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2025/nov/28/the-genocide-in-gaza-is-far-from-over\">Archived</a> from the original on November 28, 2025<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">January 4,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Guardian&amp;rft.atitle=The+genocide+in+Gaza+is+far+from+over&amp;rft.date=2025-11-28&amp;rft.aulast=Segal&amp;rft.aufirst=Raz&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theguardian.com%2Fcommentisfree%2F2025%2Fnov%2F28%2Fthe-genocide-in-gaza-is-far-from-over&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li><li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20260906195408/https://www.ohchr.org/en/press-releases/2026/03/un-expert-warns-torture-has-become-state-doctrine-israel-making-prisons\">\"UN expert warns torture has become 'state doctrine' in Israel, making prisons instruments of genocide and torture\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/OHCHR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"OHCHR\">OHCHR</a></i>. March 23, 2026. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.ohchr.org/en/press-releases/2026/03/un-expert-warns-torture-has-become-state-doctrine-israel-making-prisons\">the original</a> on September 6, 2026<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">May 17,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=OHCHR&amp;rft.atitle=UN+expert+warns+torture+has+become+%27state+doctrine%27+in+Israel%2C+making+prisons+instruments+of+genocide+and+torture&amp;rft.date=2026-03-23&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ohchr.org%2Fen%2Fpress-releases%2F2026%2F03%2Fun-expert-warns-torture-has-become-state-doctrine-israel-making-prisons&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li><li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20260714211143/https://easternherald.com/2026/04/08/gaza-genocide-children-hunger-global-silence/\">\"Gaza Genocide: Children Maimed, Hunger Spreads, World Silent\"</a>. <i>The Eastern Herald</i>. April 8, 2026. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://easternherald.com/2026/04/08/gaza-genocide-children-hunger-global-silence/\">the original</a> on July 14, 2026<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">May 17,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Eastern+Herald&amp;rft.atitle=Gaza+Genocide%3A+Children+Maimed%2C+Hunger+Spreads%2C+World+Silent&amp;rft.date=2026-04-08&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Feasternherald.com%2F2026%2F04%2F08%2Fgaza-genocide-children-hunger-global-silence%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li><li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20260907031522/https://www.msf.org/not-ceasefire-life-gaza-continues-be-suffocated-six-months\">\"This is not a ceasefire: Life in Gaza continues to be suffocated six months on\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/M%C3%A9decins_sans_fronti%C3%A8res\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Médecins sans frontières\">Médecins sans frontières</a></i>. April 10, 2026. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.msf.org/not-ceasefire-life-gaza-continues-be-suffocated-six-months\">the original</a> on September 7, 2026<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">May 17,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=M%C3%A9decins+sans+fronti%C3%A8res&amp;rft.atitle=This+is+not+a+ceasefire%3A+Life+in+Gaza+continues+to+be+suffocated+six+months+on&amp;rft.date=2026-04-10&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.msf.org%2Fnot-ceasefire-life-gaza-continues-be-suffocated-six-months&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li><li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20260914131426/https://www.amnesty.org/en/latest/news/2026/05/israel-opt-israels-systematic-destruction-of-high-rise-buildings-must-be-investigated-as-war-crimes-of-wanton-destruction-and-collective-punishment/\">\"Israel/OPT: Israel's systematic destruction of high-rise buildings must be investigated as war crimes of wanton destruction and collective punishment\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Amnesty_International\" title=\"Amnesty International\">Amnesty International</a></i>. May 11, 2026. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.amnesty.org/en/latest/news/2026/05/israel-opt-israels-systematic-destruction-of-high-rise-buildings-must-be-investigated-as-war-crimes-of-wanton-destruction-and-collective-punishment/\">the original</a> on September 14, 2026<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">May 14,</span> 2026</span>. <q>Israel's unlawful and wanton destruction of civilian high-rise buildings continues to have devastating consequences for displaced Palestinian families in the occupied Gaza Strip, where reconstruction remains a distant dream amid ongoing genocide and air strikes despite the October 2025 so-called ceasefire, said Amnesty International today.</q></cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Amnesty+International&amp;rft.atitle=Israel%2FOPT%3A+Israel%27s+systematic+destruction+of+high-rise+buildings+must+be+investigated+as+war+crimes+of+wanton+destruction+and+collective+punishment&amp;rft.date=2026-05-11&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amnesty.org%2Fen%2Flatest%2Fnews%2F2026%2F05%2Fisrael-opt-israels-systematic-destruction-of-high-rise-buildings-must-be-investigated-as-war-crimes-of-wanton-destruction-and-collective-punishment%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li><li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation news cs1\">Saifi, Zeena (June 24, 2026). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20260628171831/https://edition.cnn.com/2026/06/24/middleeast/israel-targeting-children-report-un-intl\">\"Israel deliberately targeting children in ongoing genocide against Palestinians, UN commission finds\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/CNN\" title=\"CNN\">CNN</a></i>. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://edition.cnn.com/2026/06/24/middleeast/israel-targeting-children-report-un-intl\">the original</a> on June 28, 2026.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=CNN&amp;rft.atitle=Israel+deliberately+targeting+children+in+ongoing+genocide+against+Palestinians%2C+UN+commission+finds&amp;rft.date=2026-06-24&amp;rft.aulast=Saifi&amp;rft.aufirst=Zeena&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fedition.cnn.com%2F2026%2F06%2F24%2Fmiddleeast%2Fisrael-targeting-children-report-un-intl&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li></ul></div></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;Holmes-109\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Gaza_genocide_Holmes_109-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFHolmes2026\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Holmes, Oliver (June 23, 2026). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/jun/23/israel-deliberately-targeting-gaza-children-to-commit-genocide-un-inquiry-finds\">\"Israel continues to commit genocide by targeting children in Gaza, UN inquiry finds\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Guardian\" title=\"The Guardian\">The Guardian</a></i><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">June 25,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Guardian&amp;rft.atitle=Israel+continues+to+commit+genocide+by+targeting+children+in+Gaza%2C+UN+inquiry+finds&amp;rft.date=2026-06-23&amp;rft.aulast=Holmes&amp;rft.aufirst=Oliver&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theguardian.com%2Fworld%2F2026%2Fjun%2F23%2Fisrael-deliberately-targeting-gaza-children-to-commit-genocide-un-inquiry-finds&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-110\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-110\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFLe&#95;Poidevin2026\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Le Poidevin, Olivia (June 23, 2026). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/middle-east/israel-targeted-gaza-children-resulting-genocide-un-inquiry-says-2026-06-23/\">\"Israel targeted Gaza children resulting in genocide, UN inquiry says\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Reuters\" title=\"Reuters\">Reuters</a></i><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">June 25,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Reuters&amp;rft.atitle=Israel+targeted+Gaza+children+resulting+in+genocide%2C+UN+inquiry+says&amp;rft.date=2026-06-23&amp;rft.aulast=Le+Poidevin&amp;rft.aufirst=Olivia&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.reuters.com%2Fworld%2Fmiddle-east%2Fisrael-targeted-gaza-children-resulting-genocide-un-inquiry-says-2026-06-23%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;ohchrjune26-111\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Gaza_genocide_ohchrjune26_111-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.ohchr.org/sites/default/files/documents/hrbodies/hrcouncil/sessions-regular/session62/a-hrc-62-crp-2.pdf\">\"<span class=\"cs1-kern-left\"></span>\"The essence of childhood has been destroyed\": Israel's deliberate targeting of Palestinian children in the Occupied Palestinian Territory since 7 October 2023\"</a> <span class=\"cs1-format\">(PDF)</span>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/OHCHR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"OHCHR\">OHCHR</a></i>. June 18, 2026<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">June 25,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=OHCHR&amp;rft.atitle=%22The+essence+of+childhood+has+been+destroyed%22%3A+Israel%27s+deliberate+targeting+of+Palestinian+children+in+the+Occupied+Palestinian+Territory+since+7+October+2023&amp;rft.date=2026-06-18&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ohchr.org%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2Fdocuments%2Fhrbodies%2Fhrcouncil%2Fsessions-regular%2Fsession62%2Fa-hrc-62-crp-2.pdf&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;UNCommissionGenocide-112\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-Gaza_genocide_UNCommissionGenocide_112-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Gaza_genocide_UNCommissionGenocide_112-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250925113927/https://www.ohchr.org/en/press-releases/2025/09/israel-has-committed-genocide-gaza-strip-un-commission-finds\">\"Israel has committed genocide in the Gaza Strip, UN Commission finds\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Office_of_the_United_Nations_High_Commissioner_for_Human_Rights\" title=\"Office of the United Nations High Commissioner for Human Rights\">Office of the United Nations High Commissioner for Human Rights</a></i>. September 16, 2025. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.ohchr.org/en/press-releases/2025/09/israel-has-committed-genocide-gaza-strip-un-commission-finds\">the original</a> on September 25, 2025<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">September 21,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Office+of+the+United+Nations+High+Commissioner+for+Human+Rights&amp;rft.atitle=Israel+has+committed+genocide+in+the+Gaza+Strip%2C+UN+Commission+finds&amp;rft.date=2025-09-16&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ohchr.org%2Fen%2Fpress-releases%2F2025%2F09%2Fisrael-has-committed-genocide-gaza-strip-un-commission-finds&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;UNCommitteeHeadGenocide-113\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Gaza_genocide_UNCommitteeHeadGenocide_113-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFPieris2024\" class=\"citation speech cs1\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mohan_Peiris\" title=\"Mohan Peiris\">Pieris, Mohan</a> (November 19, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.ohchr.org/en/statements-and-speeches/2024/11/genocide-unfolding-our-eyes-history-will-not-forgive-our-inaction\"><i>A genocide is unfolding before our eyes: History will not forgive our inaction, UN Special Committee warns General Assembly 4th Committee report</i></a> (Speech). <a href=\"/wiki/Office_of_the_United_Nations_High_Commissioner_for_Human_Rights\" title=\"Office of the United Nations High Commissioner for Human Rights\">Office of the United Nations High Commissioner for Human Rights</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250414205459/https://www.ohchr.org/en/statements-and-speeches/2024/11/genocide-unfolding-our-eyes-history-will-not-forgive-our-inaction\">Archived</a> from the original on April 14, 2025<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">April 9,</span> 2025</span>. <q>Our findings conclude that Israel's methods of war align with the characteristics of genocide ... Our report leaves no room for ambiguity. A genocide is unfolding before our eyes. Failing to act now—failing to put an end to this atrocity crime—will tear apart the very foundation of the international rule of law we have collectively built to protect peace, security, and the well-being of all. Our inaction today is setting a perilous precedent for tomorrow. Think about it.</q></cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=A+genocide+is+unfolding+before+our+eyes%3A+History+will+not+forgive+our+inaction%2C+UN+Special+Committee+warns+General+Assembly+4th+Committee+report&amp;rft.pub=Office+of+the+United+Nations+High+Commissioner+for+Human+Rights&amp;rft.date=2024-11-19&amp;rft.aulast=Pieris&amp;rft.aufirst=Mohan&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ohchr.org%2Fen%2Fstatements-and-speeches%2F2024%2F11%2Fgenocide-unfolding-our-eyes-history-will-not-forgive-our-inaction&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;IAGSReuters-114\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Gaza_genocide_IAGSReuters_114-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFvan&#95;den&#95;Berg2025\" class=\"citation news cs1\">van den Berg, Stephanie (September 1, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20251002183633/http://www.reuters.com/world/middle-east/israel-is-committing-genocide-gaza-scholars-association-says-2025-09-01/\">\"Israel is committing genocide in Gaza, scholars' association says\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Reuters\" title=\"Reuters\">Reuters</a></i>. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/middle-east/israel-is-committing-genocide-gaza-scholars-association-says-2025-09-01/\">the original</a> on October 2, 2025<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">September 1,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Reuters&amp;rft.atitle=Israel+is+committing+genocide+in+Gaza%2C+scholars%27+association+says&amp;rft.date=2025-09-01&amp;rft.aulast=van+den+Berg&amp;rft.aufirst=Stephanie&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.reuters.com%2Fworld%2Fmiddle-east%2Fisrael-is-committing-genocide-gaza-scholars-association-says-2025-09-01%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;IAGSResolution-115\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Gaza_genocide_IAGSResolution_115-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250902042359/https://genocidescholars.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/IAGS-Resolution-on-Gaza-FINAL.pdf\">\"IAGS Resolution on the Situation in Gaza\"</a> <span class=\"cs1-format\">(PDF)</span>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/International_Association_of_Genocide_Scholars\" title=\"International Association of Genocide Scholars\">International Association of Genocide Scholars</a></i>. August 31, 2025. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://genocidescholars.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/IAGS-Resolution-on-Gaza-FINAL.pdf\">the original</a> <span class=\"cs1-format\">(PDF)</span> on September 2, 2025<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">September 1,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=International+Association+of+Genocide+Scholars&amp;rft.atitle=IAGS+Resolution+on+the+Situation+in+Gaza&amp;rft.date=2025-08-31&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fgenocidescholars.org%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F08%2FIAGS-Resolution-on-Gaza-FINAL.pdf&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;Amnesty&#95;International&#95;Dec&#95;2024-116\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Gaza_genocide_Amnesty_International_Dec_2024_116-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"#CITEREFAmnesty_International_report2024\">Amnesty International report 2024</a>, p.&#160;13: \"This report focuses on the Israeli authorities' policies and actions in Gaza as part of the military offensive they launched in the wake of the Hamas-led attacks on 7 October 2023 while situating them within the broader context of Israel's unlawful occupation, and system of apartheid against Palestinians in Gaza, the West Bank, including East Jerusalem, and Israel. It assesses allegations of violations and crimes under international law by Israel in Gaza within the framework of genocide under international law, concluding that there is sufficient evidence to believe that Israel's conduct in Gaza following 7 October 2023 amounts to genocide.\"</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-117\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-117\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"#CITEREFMédecins_Sans_Frontières2025\">Médecins Sans Frontières 2025</a>: \"Our decision to describe what's happening in Gaza as a 'genocide' is based on nearly two years of extensive, firsthand information from our teams, who are witnessing massive levels of death and destruction by Israeli forces, a campaign of ethnic cleansing and the almost total dismantling of the health care system.\"</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-118\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-118\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"#CITEREFB&#39;Tselem2025\">B'Tselem 2025</a>, p.&#160;86: \"The review presented in this report leaves no room for doubt: since October 2023, the Israeli regime has been responsible for carrying out genocide against the Palestinians in the Gaza Strip. Killing tens of thousands of people; causing bodily or mental harm to hundreds of thousands more; destroying homes and civilian infrastructure on a massive scale; starvation, displacement, and denying humanitarian aid—all this is being perpetrated systematically, as part of a coordinated attack aimed at annihilating all facets of life in the Gaza Strip.\"</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;Kottasová&#95;&amp;&#95;Salman-119\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Gaza_genocide_Kottasová_&amp;_Salman_119-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFKottasováSalman2025\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Kottasová, Ivana; Salman, Abeer (July 28, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250728161018/https://www.cnn.com/2025/07/28/middleeast/israeli-human-rights-group-accuses-israel-genocide-gaza-intl\">\"For first time, two leading Israeli human rights groups accuse Israel of genocide in Gaza\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/CNN\" title=\"CNN\">CNN</a></i>. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.cnn.com/2025/07/28/middleeast/israeli-human-rights-group-accuses-israel-genocide-gaza-intl\">the original</a> on July 28, 2025<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">July 28,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=CNN&amp;rft.atitle=For+first+time%2C+two+leading+Israeli+human+rights+groups+accuse+Israel+of+genocide+in+Gaza&amp;rft.date=2025-07-28&amp;rft.aulast=Kottasov%C3%A1&amp;rft.aufirst=Ivana&amp;rft.au=Salman%2C+Abeer&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cnn.com%2F2025%2F07%2F28%2Fmiddleeast%2Fisraeli-human-rights-group-accuses-israel-genocide-gaza-intl&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;FIDH&#95;2023-120\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Gaza_genocide_FIDH_2023_120-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20231216191823/https://www.fidh.org/en/region/north-africa-middle-east/israel-palestine/the-unfolding-genocide-against-the-palestinians-must-stop-immediately\">\"The unfolding genocide against the Palestinians must stop immediately\"</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/International_Federation_for_Human_Rights\" title=\"International Federation for Human Rights\">International Federation for Human Rights</a>. December 12, 2023. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.fidh.org/en/region/north-africa-middle-east/israel-palestine/the-unfolding-genocide-against-the-palestinians-must-stop-immediately\">the original</a> on December 16, 2023<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">December 13,</span> 2023</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=The+unfolding+genocide+against+the+Palestinians+must+stop+immediately&amp;rft.pub=International+Federation+for+Human+Rights&amp;rft.date=2023-12-12&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.fidh.org%2Fen%2Fregion%2Fnorth-africa-middle-east%2Fisrael-palestine%2Fthe-unfolding-genocide-against-the-palestinians-must-stop-immediately&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;growing&#95;agreement-122\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Gaza_genocide_growing_agreement_122-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><div><ul><li><a href=\"#CITEREFSultany2024\">Sultany 2024</a>, p.&#160;4: \"Although legal scholars and commentators were slow to recognize the severity and urgency of the situation, this article sought to show that there is an emerging consensus that Israel's actions in Gaza are not another instance of armed conflict but instead amount to genocide\"</li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFSwart2025\">Swart 2025</a>, p.&#160;3: \"South Africa's actions led to an ever-growing consensus in international legal circles that Israel is committing genocide\"</li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFLederman2025\">Lederman 2025</a>, p.&#160;1: \"Roughly since mid-2024, there seems to have emerged a broad agreement among genocide scholars—at least those who have expressed their views on the matter—that this is indeed the case ... What followed seems to be a similar broad agreement emerging among legal scholars that this is indeed a genocide, and even those who are still hesitating find the genocide charges much more convincing.\"</li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFShaw2025b\">Shaw 2025b</a>, p.&#160;3: \"By the end of 2024, when Amnesty International published a comprehensively evidenced and legally argued case, the consensus that Israel was committing genocide was becoming overwhelming\"</li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFGessen2024\">Gessen 2024</a>: \"Trachtenberg testified to a consensus opinion among historians of genocide that what is happening in Gaza can indeed be called a genocide, largely because the intent to cause death on a massive scale has been so clear in the statements of Israeli officials\"</li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFBouranova2024\">Bouranova 2024</a>: \"The opposition is political, as there is consensus amongst the international human rights legal community, many other legal and political experts, including many Holocaust scholars, that Israel is committing genocide in Gaza.\"</li></ul></div></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;genocide&#95;int&#95;law&#95;scholars-123\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Gaza_genocide_genocide_int_law_scholars_123-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><div><ul><li><a href=\"#CITEREFMohyeldinHamdan2024\">Mohyeldin &amp; Hamdan 2024</a></li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFDe_VogliMontomoliAbu-SittahPappé2025\">De Vogli et al. 2025</a>, pp.&#160;688–689</li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFvan_LaarhovenPeekWalters2025\">van Laarhoven, Peek &amp; Walters 2025</a></li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFTharoor2025\">Tharoor 2025</a></li><li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250831192255/https://www.genocidewatch.com/single-post/genocide-emergency-gaza-11-july-2025\">\"Genocide Emergency: Gaza 11 July 2025\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Genocide_Watch\" title=\"Genocide Watch\">Genocide Watch</a></i>. July 14, 2025. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.genocidewatch.com/single-post/genocide-emergency-gaza-11-july-2025\">the original</a> on August 31, 2025<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">September 8,</span> 2025</span>. <q>Israel has engaged in all of the processes of genocide described in Genocide Watch's powerful model of the genocidal process, the Ten Stages of genocide: classification, symbolization, discrimination, dehumanization, organization, polarization, preparation, persecution, extermination, and denial.</q></cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Genocide+Watch&amp;rft.atitle=Genocide+Emergency%3A+Gaza+11+July+2025&amp;rft.date=2025-07-14&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.genocidewatch.com%2Fsingle-post%2Fgenocide-emergency-gaza-11-july-2025&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li><li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250820155439/https://www.lemkininstitute.com/statements-new-page/statement-on-why-we-call-the-israeli-attack-on-gaza-genocide\">\"Statement on Why We Call the Israeli Attack on Gaza Genocide\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Lemkin_Institute_for_Genocide_Prevention\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lemkin Institute for Genocide Prevention\">Lemkin Institute for Genocide Prevention</a></i>. December 29, 2023. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.lemkininstitute.com/statements-new-page/statement-on-why-we-call-the-israeli-attack-on-gaza-genocide\">the original</a> on August 20, 2025<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">September 8,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Lemkin+Institute+for+Genocide+Prevention&amp;rft.atitle=Statement+on+Why+We+Call+the+Israeli+Attack+on+Gaza+Genocide&amp;rft.date=2023-12-29&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lemkininstitute.com%2Fstatements-new-page%2Fstatement-on-why-we-call-the-israeli-attack-on-gaza-genocide&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li></ul></div></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-124\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-124\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><div><ul><li><a href=\"#CITEREFAlbanese2024a\">Albanese 2024a</a>, p.&#160;1: \"By analysing the patterns of violence and Israeli policies in its onslaught on Gaza, the present report concludes that there are reasonable grounds to believe that the threshold indicating that Israel has committed genocide has been met\"</li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFBurga2023\">Burga 2023</a></li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFCorder2024\">Corder 2024</a></li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFDumperBadran2024\">Dumper &amp; Badran 2024</a>, p.&#160;2: \"In this context we should not overlook the latest turning point in the history of Palestine—the attack by Hamas on 7th October 2023 on Israeli settlements adjacent to Gaza and the subsequent genocidal war that the state of Israel has carried out in the Gaza Strip.\"</li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFGritten2025\">Gritten 2025</a></li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFInternational_Federation_for_Human_Rights2024\">International Federation for Human Rights 2024</a>: \"One year ago, the FIDH International Board, its governing body elected by all its member organisations, recognised, after extensive debate and examination, that Israel was carrying out genocide against the Palestinian people in Gaza\"</li><li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20241105122046/https://press.un.org/en/2024/gapal1473.doc.htm\">\"<span class=\"cs1-kern-left\"></span>'It Is Important to Call a Genocide a Genocide,' Consider Suspending Israel's Credential as UN Member State, Experts Tell Palestinian Rights Committee\"</a>. <i>UN News</i>. <a href=\"/wiki/United_Nations\" title=\"United Nations\">United Nations</a>. October 31, 2024. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://press.un.org/en/2024/gapal1473.doc.htm\">the original</a> on November 5, 2024.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=UN+News&amp;rft.atitle=%27It+Is+Important+to+Call+a+Genocide+a+Genocide%2C%27+Consider+Suspending+Israel%27s+Credential+as+UN+Member+State%2C+Experts+Tell+Palestinian+Rights+Committee&amp;rft.date=2024-10-31&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fpress.un.org%2Fen%2F2024%2Fgapal1473.doc.htm&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFLawless2024\">Lawless 2024</a></li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFNarea2024\">Narea 2024</a></li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFQuigley2024b\">Quigley 2024b</a></li><li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://news.un.org/en/story/2024/03/1147976\">\"Rights expert finds 'reasonable grounds' genocide is being committed in Gaza\"</a>. <i>UN News</i>. <a href=\"/wiki/United_Nations\" title=\"United Nations\">United Nations</a>. March 26, 2024. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250328063126/https://news.un.org/en/story/2024/03/1147976\">Archived</a> from the original on March 28, 2025<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">April 2,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=UN+News&amp;rft.atitle=Rights+expert+finds+%27reasonable+grounds%27+genocide+is+being+committed+in+Gaza&amp;rft.date=2024-03-26&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fnews.un.org%2Fen%2Fstory%2F2024%2F03%2F1147976&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFSperi2024\">Speri 2024</a></li><li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.ohchr.org/en/press-releases/2024/11/un-special-committee-finds-israels-warfare-methods-gaza-consistent-genocide\">\"UN Special Committee finds Israel's warfare methods in Gaza consistent with genocide, including use of starvation as weapon of war\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Office_of_the_United_Nations_High_Commissioner_for_Human_Rights\" title=\"Office of the United Nations High Commissioner for Human Rights\">Office of the United Nations High Commissioner for Human Rights</a></i>. November 14, 2024. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250508073603/https://www.ohchr.org/en/press-releases/2024/11/un-special-committee-finds-israels-warfare-methods-gaza-consistent-genocide\">Archived</a> from the original on May 8, 2025<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">May 13,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Office+of+the+United+Nations+High+Commissioner+for+Human+Rights&amp;rft.atitle=UN+Special+Committee+finds+Israel%27s+warfare+methods+in+Gaza+consistent+with+genocide%2C+including+use+of+starvation+as+weapon+of+war&amp;rft.date=2024-11-14&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ohchr.org%2Fen%2Fpress-releases%2F2024%2F11%2Fun-special-committee-finds-israels-warfare-methods-gaza-consistent-genocide&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li></ul></div></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;snapshot-125\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-Gaza_genocide_snapshot_125-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Gaza_genocide_snapshot_125-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.ochaopt.org/content/reported-impact-snapshot-gaza-strip-2-september-2026\">\"Reported impact snapshot – Gaza Strip (2 September 2026)\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/United_Nations_Office_for_the_Coordination_of_Humanitarian_Affairs\" title=\"United Nations Office for the Coordination of Humanitarian Affairs\">United Nations Office for the Coordination of Humanitarian Affairs</a></i>. September 7, 2026. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20260909143436/https://www.ochaopt.org/content/reported-impact-snapshot-gaza-strip-2-september-2026\">Archived</a> from the original on September 9, 2026<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">September 9,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=United+Nations+Office+for+the+Coordination+of+Humanitarian+Affairs&amp;rft.atitle=Reported+impact+snapshot+%E2%80%93+Gaza+Strip+%282+September+2026%29&amp;rft.date=2026-09-07&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ochaopt.org%2Fcontent%2Freported-impact-snapshot-gaza-strip-2-september-2026&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;theguardian-70000-126\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Gaza_genocide_theguardian-70000_126-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFGraham-Harrison2026\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Graham-Harrison, Emma (January 30, 2026). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20260304091317/https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/jan/30/israel-military-gaza-death-toll-broadly-accurate\">\"Israel accepts health authorities' Gaza death toll is broadly accurate, saying 70,000 have died\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Guardian\" title=\"The Guardian\">The Guardian</a></i>. <a href=\"/wiki/ISSN_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ISSN (identifier)\">ISSN</a>&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://search.worldcat.org/issn/0261-3077\">0261-3077</a>. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/jan/30/israel-military-gaza-death-toll-broadly-accurate\">the original</a> on March 4, 2026<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">January 31,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Guardian&amp;rft.atitle=Israel+accepts+health+authorities%27+Gaza+death+toll+is+broadly+accurate%2C+saying+70%2C000+have+died&amp;rft.date=2026-01-30&amp;rft.issn=0261-3077&amp;rft.aulast=Graham-Harrison&amp;rft.aufirst=Emma&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theguardian.com%2Fworld%2F2026%2Fjan%2F30%2Fisrael-military-gaza-death-toll-broadly-accurate&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-FOOTNOTESchwarz2024-127\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-FOOTNOTESchwarz2024_127-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"#CITEREFSchwarz2024\">Schwarz 2024</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-FOOTNOTETanteshGraham-Harrison2024-128\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-FOOTNOTETanteshGraham-Harrison2024_128-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-FOOTNOTETanteshGraham-Harrison2024_128-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"#CITEREFTanteshGraham-Harrison2024\">Tantesh &amp; Graham-Harrison 2024</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;Spagat&#95;2024a-129\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Gaza_genocide_Spagat_2024a_129-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFSpagat2024\" class=\"citation web cs1\"><a href=\"/wiki/Michael_Spagat\" title=\"Michael Spagat\">Spagat, Mike</a> (May 28, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240710190121/https://aoav.org.uk/2024/gaza-ministry-of-health-releases-detailed-new-casualty-amidst-confusion-of-uns-death-numbers-in-gaza/\">\"Gaza Ministry of Health releases detailed new casualty data amidst confusion of UN's death numbers in Gaza\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Action_On_Armed_Violence\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action On Armed Violence\">Action On Armed Violence</a></i>. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://aoav.org.uk/2024/gaza-ministry-of-health-releases-detailed-new-casualty-amidst-confusion-of-uns-death-numbers-in-gaza/\">the original</a> on July 10, 2024<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">July 10,</span> 2024</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Action+On+Armed+Violence&amp;rft.atitle=Gaza+Ministry+of+Health+releases+detailed+new+casualty+data+amidst+confusion+of+UN%27s+death+numbers+in+Gaza&amp;rft.date=2024-05-28&amp;rft.aulast=Spagat&amp;rft.aufirst=Mike&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Faoav.org.uk%2F2024%2Fgaza-ministry-of-health-releases-detailed-new-casualty-amidst-confusion-of-uns-death-numbers-in-gaza%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-FOOTNOTEGraham-Harrison2024a-130\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-FOOTNOTEGraham-Harrison2024a_130-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"#CITEREFGraham-Harrison2024a\">Graham-Harrison 2024a</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-131\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-131\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><div><ul><li><a href=\"#CITEREFAmnesty_International_report2024\">Amnesty International report 2024</a>, p.&#160;16</li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFBuschekChristophKalischKollig2024\">Buschek et al. 2024</a></li><li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20241104093600/https://www.savethechildren.net/news/gaza-least-3100-children-aged-under-five-killed-others-risk-famine-looms\">\"Gaza: At Least 3,100 Children Aged Under Five Killed With Others at Risk as Famine Looms\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Save_the_Children\" title=\"Save the Children\">Save the Children</a></i>. October 10, 2024. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.savethechildren.net/news/gaza-least-3100-children-aged-under-five-killed-others-risk-famine-looms\">the original</a> on November 4, 2024<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">December 21,</span> 2024</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Save+the+Children&amp;rft.atitle=Gaza%3A+At+Least+3%2C100+Children+Aged+Under+Five+Killed+With+Others+at+Risk+as+Famine+Looms&amp;rft.date=2024-10-10&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.savethechildren.net%2Fnews%2Fgaza-least-3100-children-aged-under-five-killed-others-risk-famine-looms&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFSalzenstein2024\">Salzenstein 2024</a></li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFFayyad2024\">Fayyad 2024</a></li></ul></div></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-FOOTNOTEMassoudFick2023-132\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-FOOTNOTEMassoudFick2023_132-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"#CITEREFMassoudFick2023\">Massoud &amp; Fick 2023</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-133\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-133\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"#CITEREFJamaluddineAbukmailAlyCampbell2025\">Jamaluddine et al. 2025</a>: \"We estimated 64,260 deaths (95% CI 55 298–78 525) due to traumatic injury during the study period, suggesting the Palestinian MoH under-reported mortality by 41%. ... Our findings underestimate the full impact of the military operation in Gaza, as they do not account for non-trauma-related deaths resulting from health service disruption, food insecurity, and inadequate water and sanitation.\"</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;Burke&#95;2025-134\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Gaza_genocide_Burke_2025_134-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFBurke2025\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Burke, Jason (August 27, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250915182357/https://www.theguardian.com/world/2025/aug/27/children-make-up-third-of-outpatients-in-msf-hospitals-in-gaza-statistics-show\">\"A third of outpatients treated for wounds at MSF's Gaza hospitals in 2024 were children, figures show\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Guardian\" title=\"The Guardian\">The Guardian</a></i>. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2025/aug/27/children-make-up-third-of-outpatients-in-msf-hospitals-in-gaza-statistics-show\">the original</a> on September 15, 2025.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Guardian&amp;rft.atitle=A+third+of+outpatients+treated+for+wounds+at+MSF%27s+Gaza+hospitals+in+2024+were+children%2C+figures+show&amp;rft.date=2025-08-27&amp;rft.aulast=Burke&amp;rft.aufirst=Jason&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theguardian.com%2Fworld%2F2025%2Faug%2F27%2Fchildren-make-up-third-of-outpatients-in-msf-hospitals-in-gaza-statistics-show&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-FOOTNOTEGómez-UgarteChenAcostaBasellini202513-135\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-FOOTNOTEGómez-UgarteChenAcostaBasellini202513_135-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"#CITEREFGómez-UgarteChenAcostaBasellini2025\">Gómez-Ugarte et al. 2025</a>, p.&#160;13.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;Amputee&#95;stats-136\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Gaza_genocide_Amputee_stats_136-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><div><ul><li><a href=\"#CITEREFMoor2025\">Moor 2025</a></li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFHarghandiwal2025\">Harghandiwal 2025</a>, pp.&#160;1–20</li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFAbodahabElsergany2025\">Abodahab &amp; Elsergany 2025</a>, pp.&#160;1705–1710</li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFMuthumani2024\">Muthumani 2024</a>, p.&#160;e000719</li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFSherwaniStewartSamad2025\">Sherwani, Stewart &amp; Samad 2025</a>, pp.&#160;1840–1845</li><li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.un.org/unispal/document/convention-personswithdisabilities-15aug25/\">\"Percentage of Persons with Disabilities in Gaza Has Increased because of Excessive Use of Force by Israel, State of Palestine Tells Committee on Rights of Persons with Disabilities\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/United_Nations\" title=\"United Nations\">United Nations</a></i>. August 15, 2025. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250821010848/https://www.un.org/unispal/document/convention-personswithdisabilities-15aug25/\">Archived</a> from the original on August 21, 2025.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=United+Nations&amp;rft.atitle=Percentage+of+Persons+with+Disabilities+in+Gaza+Has+Increased+because+of+Excessive+Use+of+Force+by+Israel%2C+State+of+Palestine+Tells+Committee+on+Rights+of+Persons+with+Disabilities&amp;rft.date=2025-08-15&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.un.org%2Funispal%2Fdocument%2Fconvention-personswithdisabilities-15aug25%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li><li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.btselem.org/20250709_israel_denying_thousands_of_amputees_in_gaza_including_children_proper_care\">\"Israel denying treatment to thousands of Gazans who lost limbs in Israeli attacks, almost 1,000 of them children\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/B%27Tselem\" title=\"B&#39;Tselem\">B'Tselem</a></i>. July 9, 2025. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250813203918/https://www.btselem.org/20250709_israel_denying_thousands_of_amputees_in_gaza_including_children_proper_care\">Archived</a> from the original on August 13, 2025.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=B%27Tselem&amp;rft.atitle=Israel+denying+treatment+to+thousands+of+Gazans+who+lost+limbs+in+Israeli+attacks%2C+almost+1%2C000+of+them+children&amp;rft.date=2025-07-09&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.btselem.org%2F20250709&#95;israel&#95;denying&#95;thousands&#95;of&#95;amputees&#95;in&#95;gaza&#95;including&#95;children&#95;proper&#95;care&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFShataliRashidLubbadPotterton2025\">Shatali et al. 2025</a>, pp.&#160;219–225</li><li><a href=\"#CITEREFAftabYaqoobKhanJaved2025\">Aftab et al. 2025</a>, pp.&#160;226–227</li></ul></div></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;Guardian&#95;3&#95;September&#95;2025-137\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Gaza_genocide_Guardian_3_September_2025_137-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation news cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2025/sep/03/gaza-graveyard-international-humanitarian-law-unrwa-israel-middle-east-crisis-latest-updates-news\">\"Middle East crisis: at least 21,000 children disabled in Gaza during war, says UN committee – as it happened\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Guardian\" title=\"The Guardian\">The Guardian</a></i>. September 3, 2025. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20260418163432/https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2025/sep/03/gaza-graveyard-international-humanitarian-law-unrwa-israel-middle-east-crisis-latest-updates-news\">Archived</a> from the original on April 18, 2026<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">September 7,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Guardian&amp;rft.atitle=Middle+East+crisis%3A+at+least+21%2C000+children+disabled+in+Gaza+during+war%2C+says+UN+committee+%E2%80%93+as+it+happened&amp;rft.date=2025-09-03&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theguardian.com%2Fworld%2Flive%2F2025%2Fsep%2F03%2Fgaza-graveyard-international-humanitarian-law-unrwa-israel-middle-east-crisis-latest-updates-news&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-138\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-138\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation news cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/ng-interactive/2025/oct/08/young-lives-cut-short-on-an-unimaginable-scale-the-18457-children-on-gazas-list-of-war-dead\">\"Young lives cut short on an unimaginable scale: the 18,457 children on Gaza's list of war dead\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Guardian\" title=\"The Guardian\">The Guardian</a></i>. October 8, 2025<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">June 15,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Guardian&amp;rft.atitle=Young+lives+cut+short+on+an+unimaginable+scale%3A+the+18%2C457+children+on+Gaza%27s+list+of+war+dead&amp;rft.date=2025-10-08&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theguardian.com%2Fworld%2Fng-interactive%2F2025%2Foct%2F08%2Fyoung-lives-cut-short-on-an-unimaginable-scale-the-18457-children-on-gazas-list-of-war-dead&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-FOOTNOTEIPC&#95;Report&#95;August20251-139\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-FOOTNOTEIPC_Report_August20251_139-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"#CITEREFIPC_Report_August2025\">IPC Report August 2025</a>, p.&#160;1.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-140\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-140\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFKekatos2025\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Kekatos, Mary (August 23, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20251218051839/https://abcnews.go.com/International/famine-determined-parts-gaza-500000-experiencing-catastrophic-hunger/story?id=124843218\">\"Famine determined in parts of Gaza, 500,000 experiencing 'catastrophic' hunger: Report\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/ABC_News_(United_States)\" title=\"ABC News (United States)\">ABC News</a></i>. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://abcnews.go.com/International/famine-determined-parts-gaza-500000-experiencing-catastrophic-hunger/story?id=124843218\">the original</a> on December 18, 2025<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">December 1,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=ABC+News&amp;rft.atitle=Famine+determined+in+parts+of+Gaza%2C+500%2C000+experiencing+%27catastrophic%27+hunger%3A+Report&amp;rft.date=2025-08-23&amp;rft.aulast=Kekatos&amp;rft.aufirst=Mary&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fabcnews.go.com%2FInternational%2Ffamine-determined-parts-gaza-500000-experiencing-catastrophic-hunger%2Fstory%3Fid%3D124843218&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-141\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-141\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFRavid2023\" class=\"citation web cs1\">Ravid, Barak (October 15, 2023). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250915020309/https://www.axios.com/2023/10/15/israel-resumes-water-supply-to-southern-gaza-after-us-pressure\">\"Israel resumes water supply to southern Gaza after U.S. pressure\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Axios_(website)\" title=\"Axios (website)\">Axios</a></i>. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.axios.com/2023/10/15/israel-resumes-water-supply-to-southern-gaza-after-us-pressure\">the original</a> on September 15, 2025<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">September 18,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Axios&amp;rft.atitle=Israel+resumes+water+supply+to+southern+Gaza+after+U.S.+pressure&amp;rft.date=2023-10-15&amp;rft.aulast=Ravid&amp;rft.aufirst=Barak&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.axios.com%2F2023%2F10%2F15%2Fisrael-resumes-water-supply-to-southern-gaza-after-us-pressure&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-FOOTNOTENeumanBabaWood2024-142\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-FOOTNOTENeumanBabaWood2024_142-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"#CITEREFNeumanBabaWood2024\">Neuman, Baba &amp; Wood 2024</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Gaza&#95;genocide&#95;scholasticide-143\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Gaza_genocide_scholasticide_143-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.ohchr.org/en/press-releases/2024/04/un-experts-deeply-concerned-over-scholasticide-gaza\">\"UN experts deeply concerned over 'scholasticide' in Gaza\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Office_of_the_United_Nations_High_Commissioner_for_Human_Rights\" title=\"Office of the United Nations High Commissioner for Human Rights\">Office of the United Nations High Commissioner for Human Rights</a></i>. <a href=\"/wiki/United_Nations\" title=\"United Nations\">United Nations</a>. April 18, 2024. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240418145510/https://www.ohchr.org/en/press-releases/2024/04/un-experts-deeply-concerned-over-scholasticide-gaza\">Archived</a> from the original on April 18, 2024.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Office+of+the+United+Nations+High+Commissioner+for+Human+Rights&amp;rft.atitle=UN+experts+deeply+concerned+over+%27scholasticide%27+in+Gaza&amp;rft.date=2024-04-18&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ohchr.org%2Fen%2Fpress-releases%2F2024%2F04%2Fun-experts-deeply-concerned-over-scholasticide-gaza&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-144\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-144\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><div><ul><li><a href=\"#CITEREFStackShbair2024\">Stack &amp; Shbair 2024</a></li><li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicat