 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.emro.who.int/emhj-volume-31-2025/volume-31-issue-4/addressing-emergency-trauma-care-needs-in-the-gaza-strip.html\">\"Addressing emergency trauma care needs in the Gaza Strip\"</a>. <i>Eastern Mediterranean Health Journal</i>. <b>31</b> (4): <span class=\"nowrap\">226–</span>227. <a href=\"/wiki/Doi_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Doi (identifier)\">doi</a>:<span class=\"id-lock-free\" title=\"Freely accessible\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.26719%2F2025.31.4.226\">10.26719/2025.31.4.226</a></span>. <a href=\"/wiki/PMID_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"PMID (identifier)\">PMID</a>&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/40448484\">40448484</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250919105123/https://www.emro.who.int/emhj-volume-31-2025/volume-31-issue-4/addressing-emergency-trauma-care-needs-in-the-gaza-strip.html\">Archived</a> from the original on September 19, 2025.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Eastern+Mediterranean+Health+Journal&amp;rft.atitle=Addressing+emergency+trauma+care+needs+in+the+Gaza+Strip&amp;rft.volume=31&amp;rft.issue=4&amp;rft.pages=226-227&amp;rft.date=2025-04&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Adoi%2F10.26719%2F2025.31.4.226&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Apmid%2F40448484&amp;rft.aulast=Aftab&amp;rft.aufirst=Shiza&amp;rft.au=Yaqoob%2C+Eesha&amp;rft.au=Khan%2C+Shahzad+Ali&amp;rft.au=Javed%2C+Saad&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.emro.who.int%2Femhj-volume-31-2025%2Fvolume-31-issue-4%2Faddressing-emergency-trauma-care-needs-in-the-gaza-strip.html&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFAlbanese2024a\" class=\"citation report cs1\"><a href=\"/wiki/Francesca_Albanese\" title=\"Francesca Albanese\">Albanese, Francesca</a> (March 25, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://documents.un.org/doc/undoc/gen/g24/046/11/pdf/g2404611.pdf\">Anatomy of a Genocide: Report of the Special Rapporteur on the situation of human rights in the Palestinian territories occupied since 1967, Francesca Albanese</a> <span class=\"cs1-format\">(PDF)</span> (Report). <a href=\"/wiki/United_Nations_Special_Rapporteur_on_the_occupied_Palestinian_territories\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"United Nations Special Rapporteur on the occupied Palestinian territories\">United Nations Special Rapporteur on the occupied Palestinian territories</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250128173148/https://documents.un.org/doc/undoc/gen/g24/046/11/pdf/g2404611.pdf\">Archived</a> <span class=\"cs1-format\">(PDF)</span> from the original on January 28, 2025.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=report&amp;rft.btitle=Anatomy+of+a+Genocide%3A+Report+of+the+Special+Rapporteur+on+the+situation+of+human+rights+in+the+Palestinian+territories+occupied+since+1967%2C+Francesca+Albanese&amp;rft.pub=United+Nations+Special+Rapporteur+on+the+occupied+Palestinian+territories&amp;rft.date=2024-03-25&amp;rft.aulast=Albanese&amp;rft.aufirst=Francesca&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fdocuments.un.org%2Fdoc%2Fundoc%2Fgen%2Fg24%2F046%2F11%2Fpdf%2Fg2404611.pdf&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFAmnesty&#95;International&#95;report2024\" class=\"citation report cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://amnesty.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Amnesty-International-Gaza-Genocide-Report-December-4-2024.pdf\">'You Feel Like You Are Subhuman': Israel's Genocide Against Palestinians In Gaza</a> <span class=\"cs1-format\">(PDF)</span> (Report). <a href=\"/wiki/Amnesty_International\" title=\"Amnesty International\">Amnesty International</a>. December 4, 2024. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20241205121850/https://amnesty.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Amnesty-International-Gaza-Genocide-Report-December-4-2024.pdf\">Archived</a> <span class=\"cs1-format\">(PDF)</span> from the original on December 5, 2024.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=report&amp;rft.btitle=%27You+Feel+Like+You+Are+Subhuman%27%3A+Israel%27s+Genocide+Against+Palestinians+In+Gaza&amp;rft.pub=Amnesty+International&amp;rft.date=2024-12-04&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Famnesty.ca%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F12%2FAmnesty-International-Gaza-Genocide-Report-December-4-2024.pdf&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFB&#39;Tselem2025\" class=\"citation report cs1\"><a href=\"/wiki/B%27Tselem\" title=\"B&#39;Tselem\">B'Tselem</a> (July 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.btselem.org/sites/default/files/publications/202507_our_genocide_eng.pdf\">Our Genocide</a> <span class=\"cs1-format\">(PDF)</span> (Report). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250730041430/https://www.btselem.org/sites/default/files/publications/202507_our_genocide_eng.pdf\">Archived</a> <span class=\"cs1-format\">(PDF)</span> from the original on July 30, 2025.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=report&amp;rft.btitle=Our+Genocide&amp;rft.date=2025-07&amp;rft.au=B%27Tselem&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.btselem.org%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2Fpublications%2F202507&#95;our&#95;genocide&#95;eng.pdf&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFBouranova2024\" class=\"citation web cs1\">Bouranova, Alene (June 6, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.bu.edu/articles/2024/is-israel-committing-genocide-in-gaza/\">\"Is Israel Committing Genocide in Gaza? New Report from BU School of Law's International Human Rights Clinic Lays Out Case\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Boston_University\" title=\"Boston University\">Boston University</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240605211111/https://www.bu.edu/articles/2024/is-israel-committing-genocide-in-gaza/\">Archived</a> from the original on June 5, 2024<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">June 7,</span> 2024</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Boston+University&amp;rft.atitle=Is+Israel+Committing+Genocide+in+Gaza%3F+New+Report+from+BU+School+of+Law%27s+International+Human+Rights+Clinic+Lays+Out+Case&amp;rft.date=2024-06-06&amp;rft.aulast=Bouranova&amp;rft.aufirst=Alene&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bu.edu%2Farticles%2F2024%2Fis-israel-committing-genocide-in-gaza%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFBurga2023\" class=\"citation magazine cs1\">Burga, Solcyré (November 13, 2023). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://time.com/6334409/is-whats-happening-gaza-genocide-experts\">\"Is What's Happening in Gaza a Genocide? Experts Weigh In\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Time_(magazine)\" title=\"Time (magazine)\">Time</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20231125022352/https://time.com/6334409/is-whats-happening-gaza-genocide-experts/\">Archived</a> from the original on November 25, 2023<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">November 24,</span> 2023</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Time&amp;rft.atitle=Is+What%27s+Happening+in+Gaza+a+Genocide%3F+Experts+Weigh+In&amp;rft.date=2023-11-13&amp;rft.aulast=Burga&amp;rft.aufirst=Solcyr%C3%A9&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Ftime.com%2F6334409%2Fis-whats-happening-gaza-genocide-experts&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFBuschekChristophKalischKollig2024\" class=\"citation news cs1 cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source\">Buschek, Christo; Christoph, Maria; Kalisch, Muriel; Kollig, Dajana; Obermaier, Frederik; Retter, Maria (June 25, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.spiegel.de/ausland/journalisten-in-gaza-arbeiten-in-der-todeszone-a-449a6940-b3ad-40ef-ab7a-d746c01ef0eb\">\"(S+) The Gaza Project: Sie berichten aus der Todeszone – viele kostet das ihr Leben\"</a> &#91;(S+) The Gaza Project: They report from the death zone – many lose their lives&#93;. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Der_Spiegel\" title=\"Der Spiegel\">Der Spiegel</a></i> (in German). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240726062632/https://www.spiegel.de/ausland/journalisten-in-gaza-arbeiten-in-der-todeszone-a-449a6940-b3ad-40ef-ab7a-d746c01ef0eb\">Archived</a> from the original on July 26, 2024<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">August 19,</span> 2024</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Der+Spiegel&amp;rft.atitle=%28S%2B%29+The+Gaza+Project%3A+Sie+berichten+aus+der+Todeszone+%E2%80%93+viele+kostet+das+ihr+Leben&amp;rft.date=2024-06-25&amp;rft.aulast=Buschek&amp;rft.aufirst=Christo&amp;rft.au=Christoph%2C+Maria&amp;rft.au=Kalisch%2C+Muriel&amp;rft.au=Kollig%2C+Dajana&amp;rft.au=Obermaier%2C+Frederik&amp;rft.au=Retter%2C+Maria&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.spiegel.de%2Fausland%2Fjournalisten-in-gaza-arbeiten-in-der-todeszone-a-449a6940-b3ad-40ef-ab7a-d746c01ef0eb&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFCorder2024\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Corder, Mike (January 2, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://abcnews.go.com/International/wireStory/south-africas-genocide-case-israel-sets-high-stakes-106055104\">\"South Africa's genocide case against Israel sets up a high-stakes legal battle at the UN's top court\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/ABC_News_(United_States)\" title=\"ABC News (United States)\">ABC News</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240107013809/https://abcnews.go.com/International/wireStory/south-africas-genocide-case-israel-sets-high-stakes-106055104\">Archived</a> from the original on January 7, 2024<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">January 3,</span> 2024</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=ABC+News&amp;rft.atitle=South+Africa%27s+genocide+case+against+Israel+sets+up+a+high-stakes+legal+battle+at+the+UN%27s+top+court&amp;rft.date=2024-01-02&amp;rft.aulast=Corder&amp;rft.aufirst=Mike&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fabcnews.go.com%2FInternational%2FwireStory%2Fsouth-africas-genocide-case-israel-sets-high-stakes-106055104&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFDe&#95;VogliMontomoliAbu-SittahPappé2025\" class=\"citation journal cs1\">De Vogli, Roberto; Montomoli, Jonathan; Abu-Sittah, Ghassan; <a href=\"/wiki/Ilan_Papp%C3%A9\" title=\"Ilan Pappé\">Pappé, Ilan</a> (August 2025). \"Break the selective silence on the genocide in Gaza\". <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Lancet\" title=\"The Lancet\">The Lancet</a></i>. <b>406</b> (10504): <span class=\"nowrap\">688–</span>689. <a href=\"/wiki/Doi_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Doi (identifier)\">doi</a>:<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016%2FS0140-6736%2825%2901541-7\">10.1016/S0140-6736(25)01541-7</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/PMID_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"PMID (identifier)\">PMID</a>&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/40752501\">40752501</a>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Lancet&amp;rft.atitle=Break+the+selective+silence+on+the+genocide+in+Gaza&amp;rft.volume=406&amp;rft.issue=10504&amp;rft.pages=688-689&amp;rft.date=2025-08&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1016%2FS0140-6736%2825%2901541-7&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Apmid%2F40752501&amp;rft.aulast=De+Vogli&amp;rft.aufirst=Roberto&amp;rft.au=Montomoli%2C+Jonathan&amp;rft.au=Abu-Sittah%2C+Ghassan&amp;rft.au=Papp%C3%A9%2C+Ilan&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFDumperBadran2024\" class=\"citation book cs1\">Dumper, Michael; Badran, Amneh (2024). \"Introduction\". In Dumper, Michael; Badran, Amneh (eds.). <i>Routledge Handbook on Palestine</i> (1st&#160;ed.). <a href=\"/wiki/Routledge\" title=\"Routledge\">Routledge</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Doi_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Doi (identifier)\">doi</a>:<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.4324%2F9781003031994\">10.4324/9781003031994</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ISBN (identifier)\">ISBN</a>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/9781003031994\" title=\"Special:BookSources/9781003031994\"><bdi>9781003031994</bdi></a>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Introduction&amp;rft.btitle=Routledge+Handbook+on+Palestine&amp;rft.edition=1st&amp;rft.pub=Routledge&amp;rft.date=2024&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Adoi%2F10.4324%2F9781003031994&amp;rft.isbn=9781003031994&amp;rft.aulast=Dumper&amp;rft.aufirst=Michael&amp;rft.au=Badran%2C+Amneh&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFEl&#95;Chamaa2023\" class=\"citation news cs1\">El Chamaa, Mohamad (December 1, 2023). <span class=\"id-lock-subscription\" title=\"Paid subscription required\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/world/2023/11/30/gaza-library-palestinian-culture/\">\"Gazans mourn loss of their libraries: Cultural beacons and communal spaces\"</a></span>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Washington_Post\" title=\"The Washington Post\">The Washington Post</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20231205071616/http://www.washingtonpost.com/world/2023/11/30/gaza-library-palestinian-culture/\">Archived</a> from the original on December 5, 2023.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Washington+Post&amp;rft.atitle=Gazans+mourn+loss+of+their+libraries%3A+Cultural+beacons+and+communal+spaces&amp;rft.date=2023-12-01&amp;rft.aulast=El+Chamaa&amp;rft.aufirst=Mohamad&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.washingtonpost.com%2Fworld%2F2023%2F11%2F30%2Fgaza-library-palestinian-culture%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFFayyad2024\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Fayyad, Huthifa (September 17, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.middleeasteye.net/news/nearly-1000-palestinian-health-workers-killed-israeli-forces-gaza-named\">\"Nearly 1,000 Palestinian health workers killed by Israeli forces in Gaza named\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Middle_East_Eye\" title=\"Middle East Eye\">Middle East Eye</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250116123920/https://www.middleeasteye.net/news/nearly-1000-palestinian-health-workers-killed-israeli-forces-gaza-named\">Archived</a> from the original on January 16, 2025.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Middle+East+Eye&amp;rft.atitle=Nearly+1%2C000+Palestinian+health+workers+killed+by+Israeli+forces+in+Gaza+named&amp;rft.date=2024-09-17&amp;rft.aulast=Fayyad&amp;rft.aufirst=Huthifa&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.middleeasteye.net%2Fnews%2Fnearly-1000-palestinian-health-workers-killed-israeli-forces-gaza-named&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFGessen2024\" class=\"citation magazine cs1\"><a href=\"/wiki/Masha_Gessen\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Masha Gessen\">Gessen, Masha</a> (February 7, 2024). <span class=\"id-lock-subscription\" title=\"Paid subscription required\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.newyorker.com/news/our-columnists/the-limits-of-accusing-israel-of-genocide-under-international-law\">\"The Limits of Accusing Israel of Genocide\"</a></span>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_New_Yorker\" title=\"The New Yorker\">The New Yorker</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240207111514/https://www.newyorker.com/news/our-columnists/the-limits-of-accusing-israel-of-genocide-under-international-law\">Archived</a> from the original on February 7, 2024.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+New+Yorker&amp;rft.atitle=The+Limits+of+Accusing+Israel+of+Genocide&amp;rft.date=2024-02-07&amp;rft.aulast=Gessen&amp;rft.aufirst=Masha&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.newyorker.com%2Fnews%2Four-columnists%2Fthe-limits-of-accusing-israel-of-genocide-under-international-law&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFGómez-UgarteChenAcostaBasellini2025\" class=\"citation journal cs1\">Gómez-Ugarte, Ana C.; Chen, Irena; Acosta, Enrique; Basellini, Ugofilippo; Alburez-Gutierrez, Diego (October 13, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1186%2Fs12963-025-00422-9\">\"Accounting for uncertainty in conflict mortality estimation: an application to the Gaza War in 2023-2024\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Population_Health_Metrics\" title=\"Population Health Metrics\">Population Health Metrics</a></i>. <b>23</b> 55: <span class=\"nowrap\">1–</span>15. <a href=\"/wiki/Doi_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Doi (identifier)\">doi</a>:<span class=\"id-lock-free\" title=\"Freely accessible\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1186%2Fs12963-025-00422-9\">10.1186/s12963-025-00422-9</a></span>. <a href=\"/wiki/PMID_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"PMID (identifier)\">PMID</a>&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/41084007\">41084007</a>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Population+Health+Metrics&amp;rft.atitle=Accounting+for+uncertainty+in+conflict+mortality+estimation%3A+an+application+to+the+Gaza+War+in+2023-2024&amp;rft.volume=23&amp;rft.artnum=55&amp;rft.pages=1-15&amp;rft.date=2025-10-13&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1186%2Fs12963-025-00422-9&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Apmid%2F41084007&amp;rft.aulast=G%C3%B3mez-Ugarte&amp;rft.aufirst=Ana+C.&amp;rft.au=Chen%2C+Irena&amp;rft.au=Acosta%2C+Enrique&amp;rft.au=Basellini%2C+Ugofilippo&amp;rft.au=Alburez-Gutierrez%2C+Diego&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fdoi.org%2F10.1186%252Fs12963-025-00422-9&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFGraham-Harrison2024a\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Graham-Harrison, Emma (February 25, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2024/feb/25/gaza-death-toll-set-to-pass-30000-as-israel-prepares-assault-on-rafah\">\"Gaza death toll set to pass 30,000, as Israel prepares assault on Rafah\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Guardian\" title=\"The Guardian\">The Guardian</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240227025505/https://www.theguardian.com/world/2024/feb/25/gaza-death-toll-set-to-pass-30000-as-israel-prepares-assault-on-rafah\">Archived</a> from the original on February 27, 2024.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Guardian&amp;rft.atitle=Gaza+death+toll+set+to+pass+30%2C000%2C+as+Israel+prepares+assault+on+Rafah&amp;rft.date=2024-02-25&amp;rft.aulast=Graham-Harrison&amp;rft.aufirst=Emma&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theguardian.com%2Fworld%2F2024%2Ffeb%2F25%2Fgaza-death-toll-set-to-pass-30000-as-israel-prepares-assault-on-rafah&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFGritten2025\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Gritten, David (March 14, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/clyr154314vo\">\"UN experts accuse Israel of genocidal acts and sexual violence in Gaza\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/BBC_News\" title=\"BBC News\">BBC News</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250315061814/https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/clyr154314vo\">Archived</a> from the original on March 15, 2025.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=BBC+News&amp;rft.atitle=UN+experts+accuse+Israel+of+genocidal+acts+and+sexual+violence+in+Gaza&amp;rft.date=2025-03-14&amp;rft.aulast=Gritten&amp;rft.aufirst=David&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bbc.com%2Fnews%2Farticles%2Fclyr154314vo&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFHarghandiwal2025\" class=\"citation journal cs1\">Harghandiwal, Beheshta (April 22, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1080%2F17441692.2025.2495326\">\"Impact of the humanitarian crisis in Gaza on children's health: Evidence and recommendations for mitigation\"</a>. <i>Global Public Health</i>. <b>20</b> (1) ((2495326)). <a href=\"/wiki/Doi_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Doi (identifier)\">doi</a>:<span class=\"id-lock-free\" title=\"Freely accessible\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1080%2F17441692.2025.2495326\">10.1080/17441692.2025.2495326</a></span>. <a href=\"/wiki/PMID_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"PMID (identifier)\">PMID</a>&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/40260702\">40260702</a>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Global+Public+Health&amp;rft.atitle=Impact+of+the+humanitarian+crisis+in+Gaza+on+children%27s+health%3A+Evidence+and+recommendations+for+mitigation&amp;rft.volume=20&amp;rft.issue=1&amp;rft.artnum=%28%282495326%29%29&amp;rft.date=2025-04-22&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1080%2F17441692.2025.2495326&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Apmid%2F40260702&amp;rft.aulast=Harghandiwal&amp;rft.aufirst=Beheshta&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fdoi.org%2F10.1080%252F17441692.2025.2495326&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFInternational&#95;Federation&#95;for&#95;Human&#95;Rights2024\" class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.fidh.org/en/region/north-africa-middle-east/israel-palestine/one-year-of-denouncing-the-genocide-of-palestinians-in-gaza\">\"One year of denouncing the genocide of Palestinians in Gaza\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/International_Federation_for_Human_Rights\" title=\"International Federation for Human Rights\">International Federation for Human Rights</a></i>. December 12, 2024<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">June 4,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=International+Federation+for+Human+Rights&amp;rft.atitle=One+year+of+denouncing+the+genocide+of+Palestinians+in+Gaza&amp;rft.date=2024-12-12&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.fidh.org%2Fen%2Fregion%2Fnorth-africa-middle-east%2Fisrael-palestine%2Fone-year-of-denouncing-the-genocide-of-palestinians-in-gaza&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFIPC&#95;Report&#95;August2025\" class=\"citation web cs1\">IPC global initiative (August 22, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.ipcinfo.org/fileadmin/user_upload/ipcinfo/docs/IPC_Gaza_Strip_Acute_Food_Insecurity_Malnutrition_July_Sept2025_Special_Snapshot.pdf\">\"GAZA STRIP: Famine confirmed in Gaza Governorate, projected to expand &#124; 1 July – 30 September 2025\"</a> <span class=\"cs1-format\">(PDF)</span>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Integrated_Food_Security_Phase_Classification\" title=\"Integrated Food Security Phase Classification\">Integrated Food Security Phase Classification</a></i>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Integrated+Food+Security+Phase+Classification&amp;rft.atitle=GAZA+STRIP%3A+Famine+confirmed+in+Gaza+Governorate%2C+projected+to+expand+%26%23124%3B+1+July+%E2%80%93+30+September+2025&amp;rft.date=2025-08-22&amp;rft.au=IPC+global+initiative&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ipcinfo.org%2Ffileadmin%2Fuser&#95;upload%2Fipcinfo%2Fdocs%2FIPC&#95;Gaza&#95;Strip&#95;Acute&#95;Food&#95;Insecurity&#95;Malnutrition&#95;July&#95;Sept2025&#95;Special&#95;Snapshot.pdf&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFJamaluddineAbukmailAlyCampbell2025\" class=\"citation journal cs1\">Jamaluddine, Zeina; Abukmail, Hanan; Aly, Sarah; Campbell, Oona M. R.; Checchi, Francesco (January 9, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016%2FS0140-6736%2824%2902678-3\">\"Traumatic injury mortality in the Gaza Strip from Oct 7, 2023, to June 30, 2024: a capture–recapture analysis\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Lancet\" title=\"The Lancet\">The Lancet</a></i>. <b>405</b> (10477). Elsevier: <span class=\"nowrap\">469–</span>477. <a href=\"/wiki/Doi_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Doi (identifier)\">doi</a>:<span class=\"id-lock-free\" title=\"Freely accessible\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016%2FS0140-6736%2824%2902678-3\">10.1016/S0140-6736(24)02678-3</a></span>. <a href=\"/wiki/PMID_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"PMID (identifier)\">PMID</a>&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/39799952\">39799952</a>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Lancet&amp;rft.atitle=Traumatic+injury+mortality+in+the+Gaza+Strip+from+Oct+7%2C+2023%2C+to+June+30%2C+2024%3A+a+capture%E2%80%93recapture+analysis&amp;rft.volume=405&amp;rft.issue=10477&amp;rft.pages=469-477&amp;rft.date=2025-01-09&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1016%2FS0140-6736%2824%2902678-3&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Apmid%2F39799952&amp;rft.aulast=Jamaluddine&amp;rft.aufirst=Zeina&amp;rft.au=Abukmail%2C+Hanan&amp;rft.au=Aly%2C+Sarah&amp;rft.au=Campbell%2C+Oona+M.+R.&amp;rft.au=Checchi%2C+Francesco&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fdoi.org%2F10.1016%252FS0140-6736%252824%252902678-3&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFKansaraNour2024\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Kansara, Reha; Nour, Ahmed (January 29, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-middle-east-67983018\">\"Israel-Gaza war: Counting the destruction of religious sites\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/BBC_News\" title=\"BBC News\">BBC News</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240814180602/https://www.bbc.com/news/world-middle-east-67983018\">Archived</a> from the original on August 14, 2024.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=BBC+News&amp;rft.atitle=Israel-Gaza+war%3A+Counting+the+destruction+of+religious+sites&amp;rft.date=2024-01-29&amp;rft.aulast=Kansara&amp;rft.aufirst=Reha&amp;rft.au=Nour%2C+Ahmed&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bbc.com%2Fnews%2Fworld-middle-east-67983018&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFvan&#95;LaarhovenPeekWalters2025\" class=\"citation news cs1 cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source\">van Laarhoven, Kasper; Peek, Eva; Walters, Derk (May 14, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nrc.nl/nieuws/2025/05/14/zeven-gerenommeerde-wetenschappers-vrijwel-eensgezind-israel-pleegt-in-gaza-genocide-a4893293\">\"Zeven gerenommeerde wetenschappers vrijwel eensgezind: Israël pleegt in Gaza genocide\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/NRC_(newspaper)\" title=\"NRC (newspaper)\">NRC</a></i> (in Dutch). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250515114020/https://www.nrc.nl/nieuws/2025/05/14/zeven-gerenommeerde-wetenschappers-vrijwel-eensgezind-israel-pleegt-in-gaza-genocide-a4893293\">Archived</a> from the original on May 15, 2025<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">May 27,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=NRC&amp;rft.atitle=Zeven+gerenommeerde+wetenschappers+vrijwel+eensgezind%3A+Isra%C3%ABl+pleegt+in+Gaza+genocide&amp;rft.date=2025-05-14&amp;rft.aulast=van+Laarhoven&amp;rft.aufirst=Kasper&amp;rft.au=Peek%2C+Eva&amp;rft.au=Walters%2C+Derk&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nrc.nl%2Fnieuws%2F2025%2F05%2F14%2Fzeven-gerenommeerde-wetenschappers-vrijwel-eensgezind-israel-pleegt-in-gaza-genocide-a4893293&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFLawless2024\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Lawless, Jill (July 12, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://apnews.com/article/uk-israel-allies-arm-sales-19430d222e6a2f61ffd264e9e494bf63\">\"Senior UK jurists have joined calls to stop arms sales to Israel. Other allies face similar pressure\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Associated_Press\" title=\"Associated Press\">Associated Press</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240726180806/https://apnews.com/article/uk-israel-allies-arm-sales-19430d222e6a2f61ffd264e9e494bf63\">Archived</a> from the original on July 26, 2024.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Associated+Press&amp;rft.atitle=Senior+UK+jurists+have+joined+calls+to+stop+arms+sales+to+Israel.+Other+allies+face+similar+pressure&amp;rft.date=2024-07-12&amp;rft.aulast=Lawless&amp;rft.aufirst=Jill&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fapnews.com%2Farticle%2Fuk-israel-allies-arm-sales-19430d222e6a2f61ffd264e9e494bf63&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFLederman2025\" class=\"citation journal cs1\">Lederman, Shmuel (September 19, 2025). \"A Not So Textbook Case of Genocide\". <i><a href=\"/wiki/Journal_of_Genocide_Research\" title=\"Journal of Genocide Research\">Journal of Genocide Research</a></i> (Roundtable: Gaza and Genocide Studies): <span class=\"nowrap\">1–</span>12. <a href=\"/wiki/Doi_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Doi (identifier)\">doi</a>:<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1080%2F14623528.2025.2556550\">10.1080/14623528.2025.2556550</a>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Journal+of+Genocide+Research&amp;rft.atitle=A+Not+So+Textbook+Case+of+Genocide&amp;rft.issue=Roundtable%3A+Gaza+and+Genocide+Studies&amp;rft.pages=1-12&amp;rft.date=2025-09-19&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1080%2F14623528.2025.2556550&amp;rft.aulast=Lederman&amp;rft.aufirst=Shmuel&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFMassoudFick2023\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Massoud, Bassam; Fick, Maggie (December 23, 2023). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/middle-east/fight-keep-counting-dead-gaza-2023-12-21/\">\"Gaza death toll: why counting the dead has become a daily struggle\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Reuters\" title=\"Reuters\">Reuters</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240114213315/https://www.reuters.com/world/middle-east/fight-keep-counting-dead-gaza-2023-12-21/\">Archived</a> from the original on January 14, 2024.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Reuters&amp;rft.atitle=Gaza+death+toll%3A+why+counting+the+dead+has+become+a+daily+struggle&amp;rft.date=2023-12-23&amp;rft.aulast=Massoud&amp;rft.aufirst=Bassam&amp;rft.au=Fick%2C+Maggie&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.reuters.com%2Fworld%2Fmiddle-east%2Ffight-keep-counting-dead-gaza-2023-12-21%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFMédecins&#95;Sans&#95;Frontières2025\" class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://msf.org.uk/issues/gaza-genocide\">\"Gaza genocide\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/M%C3%A9decins_Sans_Fronti%C3%A8res\" title=\"Médecins Sans Frontières\">Médecins Sans Frontières</a></i>. July 10, 2025. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250710113434/https://msf.org.uk/issues/gaza-genocide\">Archived</a> from the original on July 10, 2025.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=M%C3%A9decins+Sans+Fronti%C3%A8res&amp;rft.atitle=Gaza+genocide&amp;rft.date=2025-07-10&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fmsf.org.uk%2Fissues%2Fgaza-genocide&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFMohyeldinHamdan2024\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Mohyeldin, Ayman; Hamdan, Basel (December 10, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.msnbc.com/top-stories/latest/israel-gaza-genocide-netanyahu-rcna183485\">\"Why Amnesty International and other experts say Israel is committing genocide in Gaza\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/MSNBC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MSNBC\">MSNBC</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250703062158/https://www.msnbc.com/top-stories/latest/israel-gaza-genocide-netanyahu-rcna183485\">Archived</a> from the original on July 3, 2025.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=MSNBC&amp;rft.atitle=Why+Amnesty+International+and+other+experts+say+Israel+is+committing+genocide+in+Gaza&amp;rft.date=2024-12-10&amp;rft.aulast=Mohyeldin&amp;rft.aufirst=Ayman&amp;rft.au=Hamdan%2C+Basel&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.msnbc.com%2Ftop-stories%2Flatest%2Fisrael-gaza-genocide-netanyahu-rcna183485&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFMoor2025\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Moor, Ahmed (March 27, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/ng-interactive/2025/mar/27/gaza-palestine-children-injuries\">\"There are more child amputees in Gaza than anywhere else in the world. What can the future hold for them?\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Guardian\" title=\"The Guardian\">The Guardian</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250816034432/https://www.theguardian.com/world/ng-interactive/2025/mar/27/gaza-palestine-children-injuries\">Archived</a> from the original on August 16, 2025.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Guardian&amp;rft.atitle=There+are+more+child+amputees+in+Gaza+than+anywhere+else+in+the+world.+What+can+the+future+hold+for+them%3F&amp;rft.date=2025-03-27&amp;rft.aulast=Moor&amp;rft.aufirst=Ahmed&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theguardian.com%2Fworld%2Fng-interactive%2F2025%2Fmar%2F27%2Fgaza-palestine-children-injuries&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFMoutafa2023\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Moutafa, Laila Hussein (December 12, 2023). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.latimes.com/opinion/story/2023-12-12/gaza-library-bombing\">\"Opinion: When libraries like Gaza's are destroyed, what's lost is far more than books\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Los_Angeles_Times\" title=\"Los Angeles Times\">Los Angeles Times</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240808195337/https://www.latimes.com/opinion/story/2023-12-12/gaza-library-bombing\">Archived</a> from the original on August 8, 2024.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Los+Angeles+Times&amp;rft.atitle=Opinion%3A+When+libraries+like+Gaza%27s+are+destroyed%2C+what%27s+lost+is+far+more+than+books&amp;rft.date=2023-12-12&amp;rft.aulast=Moutafa&amp;rft.aufirst=Laila+Hussein&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.latimes.com%2Fopinion%2Fstory%2F2023-12-12%2Fgaza-library-bombing&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link re