26+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFNarea2024\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Narea, Nicole (October 25, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.vox.com/politics/378913/israel-gaza-genocide-icj\">\"Is Israel committing genocide? Reexamining the question, a year later\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Vox_(website)\" title=\"Vox (website)\">Vox</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20260713140215/https://www.vox.com/politics/378913/israel-gaza-genocide-icj\">Archived</a> from the original on July 13, 2026<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">October 28,</span> 2024</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Vox&amp;rft.atitle=Is+Israel+committing+genocide%3F+Reexamining+the+question%2C+a+year+later.&amp;rft.date=2024-10-25&amp;rft.aulast=Narea&amp;rft.aufirst=Nicole&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.vox.com%2Fpolitics%2F378913%2Fisrael-gaza-genocide-icj&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFNeumanBabaWood2024\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Neuman, Scott; Baba, Anas; Wood, Daniel (June 1, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.npr.org/2024/06/01/g-s1-1780/gaza-israel-infrastructure-water-schools-hospitals\">\"In Gaza, months of war have left Palestinians with barely the necessities to survive\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/NPR\" title=\"NPR\">NPR</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240822170339/https://www.npr.org/2024/06/01/g-s1-1780/gaza-israel-infrastructure-water-schools-hospitals\">Archived</a> from the original on August 22, 2024.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=NPR&amp;rft.atitle=In+Gaza%2C+months+of+war+have+left+Palestinians+with+barely+the+necessities+to+survive&amp;rft.date=2024-06-01&amp;rft.aulast=Neuman&amp;rft.aufirst=Scott&amp;rft.au=Baba%2C+Anas&amp;rft.au=Wood%2C+Daniel&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.npr.org%2F2024%2F06%2F01%2Fg-s1-1780%2Fgaza-israel-infrastructure-water-schools-hospitals&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFQuigley2024b\" class=\"citation web cs1\">Quigley, John (July 3, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://arabcenterdc.org/resource/the-lancet-and-genocide-by-slow-death-in-gaza/\">\"The Lancet and Genocide By \"Slow Death\" in Gaza\"</a>. <i>Arab Center Washington DC</i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240713161805/https://arabcenterdc.org/resource/the-lancet-and-genocide-by-slow-death-in-gaza/\">Archived</a> from the original on July 13, 2024<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">July 13,</span> 2024</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Arab+Center+Washington+DC&amp;rft.atitle=The+Lancet+and+Genocide+By+%22Slow+Death%22+in+Gaza&amp;rft.date=2024-07-03&amp;rft.aulast=Quigley&amp;rft.aufirst=John&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Farabcenterdc.org%2Fresource%2Fthe-lancet-and-genocide-by-slow-death-in-gaza%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFSaber2024\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Saber, Indlieb Farazi (January 14, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2024/1/14/a-cultural-genocide-which-of-gazas-heritage-sites-have-been-destroyed\">\"A 'cultural genocide': Which of Gaza's heritage sites have been destroyed?\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Al_Jazeera_English\" title=\"Al Jazeera English\">Al Jazeera</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240813215702/https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2024/1/14/a-cultural-genocide-which-of-gazas-heritage-sites-have-been-destroyed\">Archived</a> from the original on August 13, 2024.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Al+Jazeera&amp;rft.atitle=A+%27cultural+genocide%27%3A+Which+of+Gaza%27s+heritage+sites+have+been+destroyed%3F&amp;rft.date=2024-01-14&amp;rft.aulast=Saber&amp;rft.aufirst=Indlieb+Farazi&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aljazeera.com%2Fnews%2F2024%2F1%2F14%2Fa-cultural-genocide-which-of-gazas-heritage-sites-have-been-destroyed&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFSalzenstein2024\" class=\"citation magazine cs1\">Salzenstein, Léopold (March 21, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.thenewhumanitarian.org/maps-and-graphics/2024/03/21/behind-numbers-gaza-unprecedented-aid-worker-death-toll\">\"Behind the numbers: Gaza's unprecedented aid worker death toll\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_New_Humanitarian\" title=\"The New Humanitarian\">The New Humanitarian</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20241219094542/https://www.thenewhumanitarian.org/maps-and-graphics/2024/03/21/behind-numbers-gaza-unprecedented-aid-worker-death-toll\">Archived</a> from the original on December 19, 2024<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">December 21,</span> 2024</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+New+Humanitarian&amp;rft.atitle=Behind+the+numbers%3A+Gaza%27s+unprecedented+aid+worker+death+toll&amp;rft.date=2024-03-21&amp;rft.aulast=Salzenstein&amp;rft.aufirst=L%C3%A9opold&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.thenewhumanitarian.org%2Fmaps-and-graphics%2F2024%2F03%2F21%2Fbehind-numbers-gaza-unprecedented-aid-worker-death-toll&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFSchwarz2024\" class=\"citation news cs1 cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source\">Schwarz, Franziska (August 16, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.fr.de/politik/israel-news-nahost-gaza-krieg-tote-zahl-statistik-hamas-un-voelkerrecht-waffenruhe-geisel-freilassung-zr-93245254.html\">\"<span class=\"cs1-kern-left\"></span>\"Düsterer Meilenstein\": UN benennt Zahl der täglichen Toten im Gazastreifen\"</a> &#91;\"Gloomy milestone\": UN names number of daily deaths in the Gaza Strip&#93;. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Frankfurter_Rundschau\" title=\"Frankfurter Rundschau\">Frankfurter Rundschau</a></i> (in German). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240823051453/https://www.fr.de/politik/israel-news-nahost-gaza-krieg-tote-zahl-statistik-hamas-un-voelkerrecht-waffenruhe-geisel-freilassung-zr-93245254.html\">Archived</a> from the original on August 23, 2024<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">August 19,</span> 2024</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Frankfurter+Rundschau&amp;rft.atitle=%22D%C3%BCsterer+Meilenstein%22%3A+UN+benennt+Zahl+der+t%C3%A4glichen+Toten+im+Gazastreifen&amp;rft.date=2024-08-16&amp;rft.aulast=Schwarz&amp;rft.aufirst=Franziska&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.fr.de%2Fpolitik%2Fisrael-news-nahost-gaza-krieg-tote-zahl-statistik-hamas-un-voelkerrecht-waffenruhe-geisel-freilassung-zr-93245254.html&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFShataliRashidLubbadPotterton2025\" class=\"citation journal cs1\">Shatali, Ala; Rashid, Fatima; Lubbad, Ilham; Potterton, Joanne; Geilen, Bart; Ali, Sanah; Sidhanee, Abu (April 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.emro.who.int/emhj-volume-31-2025/volume-31-issue-4/meeting-the-rehabilitation-needs-of-children-with-debilitating-injuries-and-disability-in-gaza.html\">\"Meeting the rehabilitation needs of children with debilitating injuries and disability in Gaza\"</a>. <i>Eastern Mediterranean Health Journal</i>. <b>31</b> (4): <span class=\"nowrap\">219–</span>225. <a href=\"/wiki/Doi_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Doi (identifier)\">doi</a>:<span class=\"id-lock-free\" title=\"Freely accessible\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.26719%2F2025.31.4.219\">10.26719/2025.31.4.219</a></span>. <a href=\"/wiki/PMID_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"PMID (identifier)\">PMID</a>&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/40448483\">40448483</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250919104943/https://www.emro.who.int/emhj-volume-31-2025/volume-31-issue-4/meeting-the-rehabilitation-needs-of-children-with-debilitating-injuries-and-disability-in-gaza.html\">Archived</a> from the original on September 19, 2025.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Eastern+Mediterranean+Health+Journal&amp;rft.atitle=Meeting+the+rehabilitation+needs+of+children+with+debilitating+injuries+and+disability+in+Gaza&amp;rft.volume=31&amp;rft.issue=4&amp;rft.pages=219-225&amp;rft.date=2025-04&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Adoi%2F10.26719%2F2025.31.4.219&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Apmid%2F40448483&amp;rft.aulast=Shatali&amp;rft.aufirst=Ala&amp;rft.au=Rashid%2C+Fatima&amp;rft.au=Lubbad%2C+Ilham&amp;rft.au=Potterton%2C+Joanne&amp;rft.au=Geilen%2C+Bart&amp;rft.au=Ali%2C+Sanah&amp;rft.au=Sidhanee%2C+Abu&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.emro.who.int%2Femhj-volume-31-2025%2Fvolume-31-issue-4%2Fmeeting-the-rehabilitation-needs-of-children-with-debilitating-injuries-and-disability-in-gaza.html&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFShaw2025b\" class=\"citation journal cs1\"><a href=\"/wiki/Martin_Shaw_(sociologist)\" title=\"Martin Shaw (sociologist)\">Shaw, Martin</a> (September 19, 2025). \"The Genocide that Changed the World\". <i><a href=\"/wiki/Journal_of_Genocide_Research\" title=\"Journal of Genocide Research\">Journal of Genocide Research</a></i> (Roundtable: Gaza and Genocide Studies): <span class=\"nowrap\">1–</span>15. <a href=\"/wiki/Doi_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Doi (identifier)\">doi</a>:<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1080%2F14623528.2025.2556575\">10.1080/14623528.2025.2556575</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Hdl_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hdl (identifier)\">hdl</a>:<span class=\"id-lock-free\" title=\"Freely accessible\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://hdl.handle.net/10230%2F71505\">10230/71505</a></span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Journal+of+Genocide+Research&amp;rft.atitle=The+Genocide+that+Changed+the+World&amp;rft.issue=Roundtable%3A+Gaza+and+Genocide+Studies&amp;rft.pages=1-15&amp;rft.date=2025-09-19&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Ahdl%2F10230%2F71505&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1080%2F14623528.2025.2556575&amp;rft.aulast=Shaw&amp;rft.aufirst=Martin&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFSherwaniStewartSamad2025\" class=\"citation journal cs1\">Sherwani, Maryam; Stewart, Richard; Samad, Lubna (March 10, 2025). \"The Disproportionate Surgical Burden Borne by Children in Regions of Armed Conflict\". <i>World Journal of Surgery</i>. <b>49</b> (7): <span class=\"nowrap\">1840–</span>1845. <a href=\"/wiki/Doi_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Doi (identifier)\">doi</a>:<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002%2Fwjs.12560\">10.1002/wjs.12560</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/PMID_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"PMID (identifier)\">PMID</a>&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/40133763\">40133763</a>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=World+Journal+of+Surgery&amp;rft.atitle=The+Disproportionate+Surgical+Burden+Borne+by+Children+in+Regions+of+Armed+Conflict&amp;rft.volume=49&amp;rft.issue=7&amp;rft.pages=1840-1845&amp;rft.date=2025-03-10&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1002%2Fwjs.12560&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Apmid%2F40133763&amp;rft.aulast=Sherwani&amp;rft.aufirst=Maryam&amp;rft.au=Stewart%2C+Richard&amp;rft.au=Samad%2C+Lubna&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFSperi2024\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Speri, Alice (December 20, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/dec/20/genocide-definition-mass-violence-scholars-gaza\">\"Defining genocide: how a rift over Gaza sparked a crisis among scholars\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Guardian\" title=\"The Guardian\">The Guardian</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20241221004249/https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/dec/20/genocide-definition-mass-violence-scholars-gaza\">Archived</a> from the original on December 21, 2024.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Guardian&amp;rft.atitle=Defining+genocide%3A+how+a+rift+over+Gaza+sparked+a+crisis+among+scholars&amp;rft.date=2024-12-20&amp;rft.aulast=Speri&amp;rft.aufirst=Alice&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theguardian.com%2Fus-news%2F2024%2Fdec%2F20%2Fgenocide-definition-mass-violence-scholars-gaza&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFStackShbair2024\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Stack, Liam; Shbair, Bilal (May 6, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2024/05/06/world/middleeast/gaza-schools-damaged-destroyed.html\">\"With Schools in Ruins, Education in Gaza Will Be Hobbled for Years\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_New_York_Times\" title=\"The New York Times\">The New York Times</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240715234037/https://www.nytimes.com/2024/05/06/world/middleeast/gaza-schools-damaged-destroyed.html\">Archived</a> from the original on July 15, 2024.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+New+York+Times&amp;rft.atitle=With+Schools+in+Ruins%2C+Education+in+Gaza+Will+Be+Hobbled+for+Years&amp;rft.date=2024-05-06&amp;rft.aulast=Stack&amp;rft.aufirst=Liam&amp;rft.au=Shbair%2C+Bilal&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nytimes.com%2F2024%2F05%2F06%2Fworld%2Fmiddleeast%2Fgaza-schools-damaged-destroyed.html&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></li>\n<li><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFSultany2024\" class=\"citation journal cs1\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nimer_Sultany\" title=\"Nimer Sultany\">Sultany, Nimer</a> (May 9, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1080%2F14623528.2024.2351261\">\"A Threshold Crossed: On Genocidal Intent and the Duty to Prevent Genocide in Palestine\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Journal_of_Genocide_Research\" title=\"Journal of Genocide Research\">Journal of Genocide Research</a></i> (Forum: Gaza: International Humanitarian Law and Genocide): <span class=\"nowrap\">1–</span>26. <a href=\"/wiki/Doi_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Doi (identifier)\">doi</a>:<span class=\"id-lock-free\" title=\"Freely accessible\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1080%2F14623528.2024.2351261\">10.1080/14623528.2024.2351261</a></span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Journal+of+Genocide+Research&amp;rft.atitle=A+Threshold+Crossed%3A+On+Genocidal+Intent+and+the+Duty+to+Prevent+Genocide+in+Palestine&amp;rft.issue=Forum%3A+Gaza%3A+International+Humanitarian+Law+and+Genocide&amp;